j_auroc: 0.59\n      scierc_re_cond_logprob_rho: 0.19\n      scierc_re_cond_sj_rho: 0.33\n      scierc_re_cond_sj_auroc: 0.65\n      n_ner: 529\n      n_re: 397\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档的关键：logprob 在 NER 上与 SJ 差距仅 Δρ=0.03、ΔAUROC=0.03，\n      统计上 bootstrap CI 重叠。原理——fine-tuned 8B 模型的 softmax 已 well-calibrated，\n      logprob 隐式编码了 entity span 正确性的全部信息。SJ 的额外 8 次采样只带来 +0.03 ρ 的微弱增益，\n      reviewer 认为这不 justify 8x 推理成本。更致命的是 greedy_logprob（单次前向传播的 logprob）\n      ρ=0.34 实际上已经超过 SJ 的 ρ=0.36 的下界 CI。RE 上 logprob full ρ=0.25 > SJ full ρ=0.21，\n      虽然 RE cond 上 SJ 反超（0.33 vs 0.19），但 reviewer 将 conditional 分析视为 cherry-picking。\n      整体结论：SJ 对 logprob 的优势在 NER 上 marginal，在 RE full 上不存在。\n    tables:\n      - table_id: T-012-1\n        caption: \"Confidence signal comparison: log-probability vs structural signals (Spearman ρ with F1)\"\n        columns: [Dataset, Task, Log-prob ρ, SJ ρ, FK ρ, \"Δ(SJ−LP)\", \"p(Δ)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [SciERC, NER-full, 0.33, 0.36, 0.27, \"+0.03\", 0.14]\n          - [SciERC, NER-cond, 0.30, 0.37, 0.28, \"+0.07\", 0.04]\n          - [SciERC, RE-full, 0.25, 0.21, 0.25, \"−0.04\", 0.32]\n          - [SciERC, RE-cond, 0.19, 0.33, 0.28, \"+0.14\", 0.002]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Fig-012-1: Scatter plot 双联——log-prob vs F1 (left) 和 SJ vs F1 (right)，\n        SciERC NER，两者 spread 几乎一样，SJ 的 regression line 斜率仅微高于 logprob，\n        reviewer 第一眼看不出明显差别\n    analysis: >\n      Worst 档下 exp-012 的结果不是灾难性的——SJ 仍然在 NER 上微弱领先——但差距小到\n      reviewer 可以 legitimately argue \"this is not practically significant\"。\n      特别是 Δρ=0.03 在 n=529 下 p=0.14 不显著。RE full 上 logprob > SJ 给了 reviewer\n      弹药：\"SJ 在 RE 上甚至不如 logprob\"。唯一亮点是 RE cond 上 SJ 明确领先（+0.14），\n      但这需要 conditional filtering 来展示，削弱了 generality。\n      核心问题：reviewer 会说 \"so SJ is marginally better in some settings and worse in others —\n      this is a wash, not a contribution.\"\n\n  - name: baseline_exact_match\n    plan_id: exp-013\n    description: >\n      Exact-match voting rate：N 个 sample 中完全相同 entity/relation set 的比例，\n      与 F1 计算 ρ/AUROC/τ。Wang et al. 2023 self-consistency 的直接结构化推广。\n    expected_results:\n      scierc_ner_em_rho: 0.26\n      scierc_ner_em_auroc: 0.62\n      scierc_ner_em_tau: 0.19\n      scierc_re_em_rho: 0.10\n      scierc_re_em_auroc: 0.50\n      scierc_re_em_tau: 0.08\n      scierc_ner_pct_all_match: 9.1\n      scierc_ner_pct_no_match: 38.7\n      scierc_re_pct_all_match: 1.8\n      scierc_re_pct_no_match: 68.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      EM 在 NER ρ=0.26 低于 SJ(0.36) 和 logprob(0.33)，在 RE ρ=0.10 是所有 signal 中最弱。\n      这符合预期——IE 输出的 surface form 变异（span boundary 差异、entity 排列顺序差异）\n      使得 exact-match 信号极度稀疏（39% NER 样本无任何 EM pair）。但在 worst 档下这个结果\n      反而削弱了 SJ 的叙事：reviewer 会说 \"SJ 比 EM 好 only because EM is a strawman —\n      the real comparison is with logprob, which is free and equally good.\"\n      RE 上 EM AUROC=0.50 等同于随机，证明 exact-match 在 relation extraction 上完全失效。\n    tables:\n      - table_id: T-013-1\n        caption: \"Exact-match voting rate distribution and correlation\"\n        columns: [Dataset, Task, \"% all-match\", \"% no-match\", \"ρ with F1\", AUROC]\n        rows:\n          - [SciERC, NER, 9.1, 38.7, 0.26, 0.62]\n          - [SciERC, RE, 1.8, 68.2, 0.10, 0.50]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Fig-013-1: Histogram — EM rate 分布（0/8, 1/8, ..., 8/8），\n        高度集中于 0 和 1，几乎二值化的粗粒度信号\n    analysis: >\n      EM 是 self-consistency 在结构化输出上的 naïve baseline，其弱势是意料之中的。\n      在 worst 档下，这个实验的价值被 reviewer 低估——他们认为 \"of course exact-match\n      doesn't work for structured outputs, this is obvious\" 而不是将其视为\n      motivation for SJ。结果是 SJ > EM 这个子结论被视为 trivial。\n\n  - name: baseline_entity_voting\n    plan_id: exp-014\n    description: >\n      Entity-level majority voting confidence：对每个 entity 统计在 N 个 sample 中的出现频率，\n      计算 instance-level 平均 voting confidence 与 F1 的相关性。\n    expected_results:\n      scierc_ner_voting_rho: 0.37\n      scierc_ner_voting_auroc: 0.68\n      scierc_ner_voting_tau: 0.27\n      scierc_re_voting_rho: 0.30\n      scierc_re_voting_auroc: 0.64\n      scierc_re_voting_tau: 0.22\n      scierc_ner_voting_f1_selected: 0.615\n      scierc_ner_greedy_f1: 0.648\n      scierc_ner_oracle_f1: 0.779\n      scierc_ner_voting_vs_greedy_delta: -3.3\n      scierc_re_voting_f1_selected: 0.358\n      scierc_re_greedy_f1: 0.402\n      voting_minus_sj_ner_rho: 0.01\n      voting_minus_logprob_ner_rho: 0.04\n    result_rationale: >\n      Entity voting ρ=0.37 在 NER 上与 SJ(0.36) 几乎持平（Δ=+0.01），AUROC 也仅微弱领先（0.68 vs 0.67）。\n      关键是 voting vs logprob 差距也很小（+0.04 ρ）。在 worst 档下三者（voting, SJ, logprob）\n      形成一个统计上无法区分的 cluster（bootstrap CI 大量重叠），reviewer 会说\n      \"all signals perform similarly — the choice of signal doesn't matter.\"\n      Voting 作为 selection strategy（而非 quality estimation）失败得更彻底：\n      voting-selected F1=0.615 低于 greedy=0.648（−3.3pp），因为 majority vote\n      倾向于选择\"平庸但安全\"的 entity 而丢弃正确但少数的 entity。\n      RE 上 voting ρ=0.30 高于 SJ(0.21) 但仍低于 logprob 的下界期望。\n    tables:\n      - table_id: T-014-1\n        caption: \"Entity voting vs other signals (SciERC)\"\n        columns: [Signal, NER ρ, NER AUROC, RE ρ, RE AUROC]\n        rows:\n          - [Voting conf, 0.37, 0.68, 0.30, 0.64]\n          - [Soft Jaccard, 0.36, 0.67, 0.21, 0.59]\n          - [Log-prob, 0.33, 0.64, 0.25, 0.62]\n          - [Fleiss' κ, 0.27, 0.59, 0.25, 0.61]\n          - [Exact-match, 0.26, 0.62, 0.10, 0.50]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Fig-014-1: Bar chart — 5 signal 在 NER 上的 ρ，三者（voting/SJ/logprob）\n        高度接近，error bars 重叠，视觉上无明显优胜者\n    analysis: >\n      Entity voting 的加入没有改变整体叙事——在 worst 档下它只是 structural consistency\n      family 中另一个与 logprob 差距不大的 signal。Voting 作为 selection 策略失败\n      （低于 greedy -3.3pp）直接支持了 correlation-selection gap 的 narrative，\n      但 reviewer 认为这是 \"expected: instance-level aggregates can't rank individual samples.\"\n\n  - name: evaluation_metrics_expansion\n    plan_id: exp-015\n    description: >\n      在所有 confidence signal × 所有数据集上扩展评估指标：\n      AUROC、Kendall τ、ECE (calibration)。Leave-one-out SJ 检验评估 circularity。\n    expected_results:\n      scierc_ner:\n        voting_rho: 0.37\n        voting_auroc: 0.68\n        voting_tau: 0.27\n        sj_rho: 0.36\n        sj_auroc: 0.67\n        sj_tau: 0.26\n        sj_ece: 0.11\n        fk_rho: 0.27\n        fk_auroc: 0.59\n        fk_tau: 0.20\n        logprob_rho: 0.33\n        logprob_auroc: 0.64\n        logprob_tau: 0.24\n        logprob_ece: 0.08\n        em_rho: 0.26\n        em_auroc: 0.62\n        em_tau: 0.19\n        loo_sj_rho: 0.35\n        loo_sj_delta: -0.01\n        n_valid: 529\n        n_cond: 501\n      scierc_re:\n        voting_rho: 0.30\n        voting_auroc: 0.64\n        sj_rho: 0.21\n        sj_auroc: 0.59\n        logprob_rho: 0.25\n        logprob_auroc: 0.62\n        n_valid: 397\n        n_cond: 296\n      conll_ner:\n        sj_rho: 0.34\n        sj_auroc: 0.68\n        logprob_rho: 0.32\n        logprob_auroc: 0.66\n        voting_rho: 0.33\n        em_rho: 0.35\n      wnut_ner:\n        sj_rho: 0.08\n        sj_auroc: 0.55\n        logprob_rho: -0.41\n        fk_rho: 0.12\n    result_rationale: >\n      多指标扩展后的全景：AUROC gap (structural vs logprob) 在 NER 上仅 +0.03~0.04，\n      在 RE 上为负（-0.03）。ECE 上 logprob=0.08 优于 SJ=0.11，因为 logprob 天然是概率量。\n      Leave-one-out SJ ρ=0.35 vs full SJ ρ=0.36，Δ=-0.01，排除了 circularity concern，\n      但 reviewer 不会因此给加分（\"LOO 差异小是 expected, not a contribution\"）。\n      CoNLL 上 EM(0.35) > SJ(0.34) > voting(0.33) > logprob(0.32)，所有信号极接近，\n      因为 CoNLL 模型 F1 很高导致所有信号 ceiling-out。WNUT 上 SJ ρ=0.08 不显著，\n      logprob ρ=−0.41（反相关），所有 signal 失败——但 WNUT 被 abandoned，reviewer 若推断\n      这一点会进一步质疑 generalization。\n    tables:\n      - table_id: T-015-1\n        caption: \"Comprehensive 5-signal evaluation — SciERC NER (N=8, T=1.0)\"\n        columns: [Signal, \"ρ\", AUROC, \"τ\", ECE, \"LOO-ρ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Voting conf, 0.37, 0.68, 0.27, 0.10, \"—\"]\n          - [Soft Jaccard, 0.36, 0.67, 0.26, 0.11, 0.35]\n          - [Log-prob, 0.33, 0.64, 0.24, 0.08, \"—\"]\n          - [Fleiss' κ, 0.27, 0.59, 0.20, 0.14, \"—\"]\n          - [Exact-match, 0.26, 0.62, 0.19, 0.16, \"—\"]\n      - table_id: T-015-2\n        caption: \"Cross-dataset AUROC comparison\"\n        columns: [Signal, SciERC-NER, CoNLL-NER, WNUT-NER, SciERC-RE-full, SciERC-RE-cond]\n        rows:\n          - [Voting, 0.68, 0.67, 0.56, 0.64, 0.68]\n          - [SJ, 0.67, 0.68, 0.55, 0.59, 0.65]\n          - [Log-prob, 0.64, 0.66, 0.36, 0.62, 0.55]\n          - [FK, 0.59, 0.63, 0.54, 0.61, 0.58]\n          - [EM, 0.62, 0.70, 0.55, 0.50, 0.54]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Fig-015-1: Reliability diagram (calibration) — logprob 更贴合 y=x 对角线 (ECE=0.08)，\n        SJ 系统性偏高 (ECE=0.11)\n      - >\n        Fig-015-2: ROC curve — NER 上 voting 和 SJ 的 curve 仅微幅高于 logprob，\n        三条 curve 几乎重叠，bootstrap CI band 大量 overlap\n    analysis: >\n      多指标扩展的致命结果：所有指标都确认了 structural vs logprob 差距极小。\n      AUROC 差距 +0.03 比 ρ 差距 +0.03 没有更大——不存在 \"ρ understates the advantage\" 的反驳。\n      ECE 上 logprob 甚至更好。Reviewer 会指出：\"Table 2 shows that across 5 metrics,\n      logprob is competitive or better on 2 out of 5 — the claimed superiority of\n      structural signals is at best marginal.\" WNUT 数据如果被发现会是致命一击。\n\n  - name: ner_n16_scierc\n    plan_id: exp-001\n    description: >\n      SciERC NER N=16, T=1.0, ft_002_v2 模型, 3 seeds (42/123/456)。\n      测试 N-scaling 效应，采集 log-prob。\n    expected_results:\n      ner_sj_rho_n16_s42: 0.37\n      ner_sj_rho_n16_s123: 0.36\n      ner_sj_rho_n16_s456: 0.33\n      ner_sj_rho_n16_mean: 0.353\n      ner_sj_rho_n16_std: 0.021\n      ner_voting_rho_n16_mean: 0.36\n      ner_logprob_rho_n16_mean: 0.33\n      ner_fk_rho_n16_mean: 0.26\n      ner_em_rho_n16_mean: 0.30\n      ner_sj_rho_n8_mean: 0.36\n      ner_sj_rho_delta_n16_vs_n8: -0.007\n      ner_oracle_f1_n16: 0.81\n      ner_greedy_f1: 0.655\n      ner_headroom_n16: 0.155\n      re_sj_rho_n16: 0.27\n      re_logprob_rho_n16: 0.30\n      re_voting_rho_n16: 0.35\n      re_oracle_f1_n16: 0.67\n      re_sample_f1_pct_zero: 44.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      N=16 对 SJ ρ 无提升甚至微降（0.353 vs N=8 的 0.36，Δ=−0.007）。\n      Worst 档的逻辑：SJ 在 N=8 时已饱和——pairwise (N choose 2) 从 28 增到 120，\n      但额外 sample 高度冗余。Seed-to-seed 标准差 σ=0.021 说明 seed456 的低值（0.33）\n      不是噪声而是边界情况，reviewer 可能 cherry-pick 这个 seed 来论证 SJ 不 robust。\n      更关键的是 logprob（ρ=0.33）在 N=16 上与 SJ（0.353）差距仍仅 +0.02。\n      RE 上 N=16 SJ ρ=0.27 虽比 N=8 的 0.21 有提升，但 reviewer 会指出\n      \"even at N=16, RE SJ is still below 0.30 — the method doesn't work for RE.\"\n      Oracle F1 从 0.75 升到 0.81 但 SJ 选不出更好的候选——signal ceiling 明确。\n    tables:\n      - table_id: T-001-1\n        caption: \"N-scaling effect on confidence signals (SciERC, 3-seed mean)\"\n        columns: [Signal, \"ρ@N=8\", \"ρ@N=16\", \"Δ\", \"seed σ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Soft Jaccard, 0.36, 0.353, \"−0.007\", 0.021]\n          - [Voting conf, 0.37, 0.36, \"−0.01\", 0.018]\n          - [Log-prob, 0.33, 0.33, 0.00, \"—\"]\n          - [Fleiss' κ, 0.27, 0.26, \"−0.01\", 0.015]\n          - [Exact-match, 0.26, 0.30, \"+0.04\", 0.022]\n      - table_id: T-001-2\n        caption: \"Multi-seed robustness (SciERC NER N=16, SJ ρ)\"\n        columns: [Seed, NER ρ_SJ, NER ρ_logprob, RE ρ_SJ]\n        rows:\n          - [42, 0.37, 0.33, 0.27]\n          - [123, 0.36, 0.34, 0.26]\n          - [456, 0.33, 0.32, 0.27]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Fig-001-1: Line plot — N vs ρ (N=4,8,16)，SJ 在 N=8 后平坦或微降，\n        logprob 水平线几乎与 SJ 重叠\n      - >\n        Fig-001-2: 3-seed box plot — variance 小但 seed456 下拉 mean，\n        CI 与 logprob 完全 overlap\n    analysis: >\n      N=16 实验在 worst 档下是双重打击：(1) 更多 sample 不提升 SJ——\"N=8 不够\"假说被否定；\n      (2) seed-to-seed variance（0.33-0.37）覆盖了 logprob 的值域（0.32-0.34），\n      reviewer 结论：\"the two signals are statistically indistinguishable.\"\n      RE 的改善从 0.21 到 0.27 虽然存在，但仍远低于任何有意义的阈值。\n\n  - name: ner_conll2003\n    plan_id: exp-002\n    description: >\n      CoNLL-2003 上 fine-tune Qwen3-8B (LoRA) + NER (N=8, T=1.0)。\n      跨数据集泛化验证。\n    expected_results:\n      conll_greedy_f1: 0.907\n      conll_oracle_f1: 0.945\n      conll_headroom: 0.038\n      conll_sj_rho: 0.34\n      conll_sj_auroc: 0.68\n      conll_sj_tau: 0.30\n      conll_fk_rho: 0.31\n      conll_logprob_rho: 0.32\n      conll_logprob_auroc: 0.66\n      conll_em_rho: 0.35\n      conll_voting_rho: 0.33\n      conll_sj_minus_logprob: 0.02\n      conll_mean_sj: 0.86\n      conll_sample_f1_pct_zero: 2.8\n      n_valid: 2756\n    result_rationale: >\n      CoNLL 上 SJ ρ=0.34 仅比 logprob ρ=0.32 高 0.02，AUROC gap 同样仅 +0.02。\n      Worst 档的核心机制是 ceiling effect：greedy F1=0.907，mean SJ=0.86，\n      绝大多数 sample 已经很好（仅 2.8% F1=0），SJ 在高一致区域的 discriminative power 崩溃。\n      EM(0.35) 甚至微幅领先 SJ(0.34)——在 CoNLL 这种标准 NER 上 exact-match 反而\n      因为 entity 简单而足够有效，这直接削弱了 \"soft similarity is necessary\" 的论点。\n      Headroom 仅 0.038（oracle 94.5 vs greedy 90.7），best-of-N 几乎无空间。\n      Reviewer 会说：\"on CoNLL, all signals including exact-match perform similarly —\n      the structural metric adds no value for standard NER tasks.\"\n    tables:\n      - table_id: T-002-1\n        caption: \"CoNLL-2003 NER: all confidence signals (N=8, T=1.0, n=2756)\"\n        columns: [Signal, ρ, AUROC, τ, \"vs SciERC Δρ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Exact-match, 0.35, 0.70, 0.31, \"+0.09\"]\n          - [Soft Jaccard, 0.34, 0.68, 0.30, \"−0.02\"]\n          - [Voting conf, 0.33, 0.67, 0.29, \"−0.04\"]\n          - [Log-prob, 0.32, 0.66, 0.25, \"−0.01\"]\n          - [Fleiss' κ, 0.31, 0.63, 0.28, \"+0.04\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Fig-002-1: SJ 分布 histogram — 高度右偏集中于 0.85-1.0，\n        与 SciERC 更 spread-out 的分布并排对比，直观展示 ceiling effect\n    analysis: >\n      CoNLL 结果在 worst 档下暴露了 SJ 的 dataset sensitivity：在 \"easy\" NER 上\n      SJ 的优势消失（Δρ=+0.02）。更致命的是 EM 反超 SJ——\n      reviewer 会问：\"if exact-match works just as well on CoNLL, why do we need SJ?\"\n      这将被引用为 SJ 只在 SciERC 特有的 scientific entity 复杂度下有效的证据，\n      泛化性成疑。\n\n  - name: ner_wnut17\n    plan_id: exp-003\n    description: >\n      WNUT-17 (social media NER) fine-tune + inference。被 abandoned 但 data 存在。\n    expected_results:\n      wnut_greedy_f1: 0.525\n      wnut_oracle_f1: 0.664\n      wnut_headroom: 0.139\n      wnut_sj_rho_full: 0.08\n      wnut_sj_p: 0.12\n      wnut_fk_rho: 0.12\n      wnut_logprob_rho_full: -0.41\n      wnut_logprob_rho_cond: 0.35\n      wnut_sj_rho_cond: 0.28\n      wnut_sample_f1_pct_zero: 53.7\n      wnut_n_gold_empty: 598\n      wnut_n_instances: 1287\n      wnut_sj_auroc: 0.55\n      wnut_structural_beats_surface: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      WNUT 是 worst 档下的 smoking gun。SJ ρ=0.08 不显著（p=0.12），\n      53.7% 的 sample F1=0，598/1287 个 instance gold set 为空。\n      Logprob full ρ=−0.41（反相关！）说明模型在 noisy social media text 上\n      完全 uncalibrated——高 logprob 的 sample 反而更可能是 confident hallucination。\n      所有 signal 在 WNUT 上失败。虽然 paper 可以 abandon 并不报告，\n      但 reviewer 若问 \"why only 2 NER datasets?\" 或推断 WNUT 被排除，\n      会质疑 dataset cherry-picking。这是 worst 档假设的核心：\n      \"WNUT abandoned (>50% F1=0, structural rho not significant) 被发现或推断\"。\n    tables:\n      - table_id: T-003-1\n        caption: \"WNUT-17 NER results (abandoned — included for completeness)\"\n        columns: [Signal, Full ρ, Cond ρ, AUROC, Notes]\n        rows:\n          - [Soft Jaccard, 0.08, 0.28, 0.55, \"p=0.12, not significant\"]\n          - [Fleiss' κ, 0.12, 0.17, 0.54, \"\"]\n          - [Log-prob, \"−0.41\", 0.35, 0.36, \"full anti-correlated\"]\n          - [Exact-match, 0.09, 0.22, 0.53, \"\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      WNUT 被 abandoned 是正确决定——53.7% F1=0 意味着数据集超出模型能力范围。\n      但这在 worst 档下被解读为 \"generalization failure\"：paper 声称\n      structural consistency 是 universal quality estimator，\n      但在 social media domain 上甚至不 significant。\n      Reviewer 会在 weaknesses 中写：\"The authors only report results on 2 NER datasets,\n      both with relatively clean text. Applicability to noisy domains is unknown.\"\n\n  - name: re_diagnostic_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-004\n    description: >\n      RE per-relation-type 分解、bootstrap CI、threshold sensitivity、error propagation。\n    expected_results:\n      per_relation_type:\n        HYPONYM-OF: {n: 36, rho_sj: 0.38, rho_fk: 0.45, rho_logprob: 0.42}\n        CONJUNCTION: {n: 86, rho_sj: 0.28, rho_fk: 0.25, rho_logprob: 0.32}\n        USED-FOR: {n: 299, rho_sj: 0.18, rho_fk: 0.20, rho_logprob: 0.24}\n        PART-OF: {n: 44, rho_sj: 0.17, rho_fk: 0.25, rho_logprob: 0.28}\n        EVALUATE-FOR: {n: 62, rho_sj: 0.12, rho_fk: 0.18, rho_logprob: 0.22}\n        COMPARE: {n: 35, rho_sj: 0.11, rho_fk: 0.13, rho_logprob: 0.20}\n        FEATURE-OF: {n: 50, rho_sj: 0.01, rho_fk: 0.04, rho_logprob: 0.12}\n      bootstrap_ci_95:\n        re_sj_full: [0.12, 0.30]\n        re_logprob_full: [0.16, 0.34]\n        re_sj_cond: [0.22, 0.44]\n      threshold_sensitivity:\n        thr_0pct_rho_sj: 0.21\n        thr_10pct_rho_sj: 0.28\n        thr_20pct_rho_sj: 0.33\n        thr_30pct_rho_sj: 0.30\n        thr_40pct_rho_sj: 0.25\n      error_propagation:\n        head_tail_error_pct: 55.5\n        type_error_pct: 8.3\n        head_sj_rho: 0.21\n    result_rationale: >\n      RE 诊断结果在 worst 档下：(1) Per-relation-type 分析显示 logprob 在 6/7 relation types 上\n      优于 SJ，只有 HYPONYM-OF（n=36，太小不可靠）SJ 稍弱但 FK 反而最强；\n      (2) Bootstrap CI 表明 SJ full [0.12, 0.30] 与 logprob full [0.16, 0.34] 大量 overlap——\n      reviewer 会说 \"the difference is not statistically significant\"；\n      (3) Threshold sensitivity 呈 inverted-U 但 reviewer 认为 \"this is just an artifact of\n      removing low-performance instances — the remaining instances are easier by definition\"；\n      (4) FEATURE-OF 关系 SJ ρ≈0 证明某些 relation types 对 consistency 完全免疫。\n    tables:\n      - table_id: T-004-1\n        caption: \"RE diagnostic: per-relation-type ρ (SciERC)\"\n        columns: [Relation, n, SJ ρ, FK ρ, Logprob ρ]\n        rows:\n          - [HYPONYM-OF, 36, 0.38, 0.45, 0.42]\n          - [CONJUNCTION, 86, 0.28, 0.25, 0.32]\n          - [USED-FOR, 299, 0.18, 0.20, 0.24]\n          - [PART-OF, 44, 0.17, 0.25, 0.28]\n          - [EVALUATE-FOR, 62, 0.12, 0.18, 0.22]\n          - [COMPARE, 35, 0.11, 0.13, 0.20]\n          - [FEATURE-OF, 50, 0.01, 0.04, 0.12]\n      - table_id: T-004-2\n        caption: \"Threshold sensitivity (conditional exclusion %)\"\n        columns: [\"Exclusion %\", SJ ρ, Logprob ρ, n]\n        rows:\n          - [0%, 0.21, 0.25, 397]\n          - [10%, 0.28, 0.30, 357]\n          - [20%, 0.33, 0.31, 318]\n          - [30%, 0.30, 0.28, 278]\n          - [40%, 0.25, 0.24, 238]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Fig-004-1: Threshold sensitivity curve — inverted-U 峰值在 ~20%，\n        但 reviewer 注意到 logprob 也有类似 pattern，认为 non-specific to SJ\n      - >\n        Fig-004-2: Per-relation heatmap — FEATURE-OF 行全暗色（near-zero），\n        USED-FOR 行（n=299，最大类）也偏弱（SJ=0.18）\n    analysis: >\n      RE 诊断在 worst 档下提供了 task-complexity boundary 的证据，但 reviewer 的反应是\n      \"the boundary is obvious — RE is harder than NER, this doesn't need 397 instances to show.\"\n      Per-relation 分析被视为 descriptive not prescriptive——没有提出 actionable insight\n      告诉 practitioner 如何改进。Bootstrap CI overlap 成为 \"SJ ≈ logprob on RE\" 的直接证据。\n\n  - name: temperature_sensitivity_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-005\n    description: >\n      T=0.7 vs T=1.0 对比，在所有 confidence signal 上分析温度的 signal-noise tradeoff。\n    expected_results:\n      ner_sj_rho_t07: 0.39\n      ner_sj_rho_t10: 0.36\n      ner_sj_delta_temp: -0.03\n      ner_logprob_rho_t07: 0.34\n      ner_logprob_rho_t10: 0.33\n      ner_logprob_delta_temp: -0.01\n      ner_fk_rho_t07: 0.32\n      ner_fk_rho_t10: 0.27\n      ner_fk_delta_temp: -0.05\n      re_sj_rho_t07: 0.23\n      re_sj_rho_t10: 0.21\n      re_logprob_rho_t07: 0.27\n      re_logprob_rho_t10: 0.25\n      ner_mean_sj_t07: 0.78\n      ner_mean_sj_t10: 0.70\n      ner_oracle_t07: 0.758\n      ner_oracle_t10: 0.776\n      sj_temp_robust: true\n      sj_delta_rho_temp: 0.03\n    result_rationale: >\n      温度对 SJ 的影响（Δρ=−0.03）大于对 logprob（Δρ=−0.01），因为 T=1.0 增加的\n      sample diversity 降低了 pairwise SJ 均值（0.78→0.70）并增加了噪声。\n      在 worst 档下 SJ 在 T=0.7 时的 \"最佳\"性能（ρ=0.39）与 logprob（0.34）差距为 +0.05，\n      仍在 focal_rho_gap [-0.04, 0.05] 的上界。Reviewer 会说 \"SJ requires careful\n      temperature tuning to achieve even marginal gains, while logprob is robust to T.\"\n      FK 的温度敏感性（Δ=−0.05）被视为 surface metrics 的又一缺陷。\n      T=1.0 保留更多 oracle headroom（0.776 vs 0.758），但因为 selection 无法利用 headroom，\n      这个观察在 worst 档下变得 moot。\n    tables:\n      - table_id: T-005-1\n        caption: \"Temperature sensitivity: T=0.7 vs T=1.0 (SciERC)\"\n        columns: [Signal, \"NER ρ(T=0.7)\", \"NER ρ(T=1.0)\", Δ, \"RE ρ(T=0.7)\", \"RE ρ(T=1.0)\", Δ]\n        rows:\n          - [Soft Jaccard, 0.39, 0.36, \"−0.03\", 0.23, 0.21, \"−0.02\"]\n          - [Log-prob, 0.34, 0.33, \"−0.01\", 0.27, 0.25, \"−0.02\"]\n          - [Voting conf, 0.38, 0.37, \"−0.01\", 0.31, 0.30, \"−0.01\"]\n          - [Fleiss' κ, 0.32, 0.27, \"−0.05\", 0.22, 0.25, \"+0.03\"]\n          - [Exact-match, 0.28, 0.26, \"−0.02\", 0.11, 0.10, \"−0.01\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Fig-005-1: Paired scatter — 同一 instance 在 T=0.7 和 T=1.0 下的 SJ 值，\n        高相关 (r>0.85) 但 T=1.0 系统性偏低\n    analysis: >\n      温度分析排除了 \"用错温度\" 的 confound，但在 worst 档下这反而是坏消息：\n      即使在最优温度 T=0.7 下 SJ 与 logprob 差距也仅 +0.05 ρ。\n      Reviewer 评论：\"temperature tuning is another hyperparameter burden on top of\n      N-sampling, while logprob is temperature-invariant and nearly as strong.\"\n\n  - name: adaptive_compute_demo\n    plan_id: exp-006\n    description: >\n      Best-of-N selection：用各 confidence signal 选 N 个 sample 中最好的，\n      报告 F1 vs greedy/random/oracle。覆盖所有数据集和任务。\n    expected_results:\n      scierc_ner:\n        greedy: 0.618\n        random: 0.586\n        sj: 0.604\n        logprob: 0.609\n        fk: 0.608\n        voting: 0.596\n        em: 0.603\n        ensemble: 0.604\n        oracle: 0.769\n      scierc_re:\n        greedy: 0.374\n        random: 0.338\n        sj: 0.368\n        logprob: 0.397\n        fk: 0.370\n        voting: 0.338\n        oracle: 0.561\n      conll_ner:\n        greedy: 0.725\n        random: 0.692\n        sj: 0.718\n        logprob: 0.716\n        fk: 0.717\n        voting: 0.714\n        oracle: 0.757\n      ner_all_signals_leq_greedy: true\n      re_only_logprob_beats_greedy: true\n      re_logprob_gain_pp: 2.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      这是 worst 档的核心 negative finding：NER 上 ALL signals ≤ greedy。\n      SJ(0.604) < greedy(0.618) by −1.4pp，logprob(0.609) < greedy(0.618) by −0.9pp。\n      机制：best-of-N selection 需要 PER-SAMPLE ranking ability，而 consistency signals\n      (SJ/voting) 是 INSTANCE-LEVEL aggregates——它们告诉你\"这个 input 容易还是难\"，\n      但不能告诉你\"哪个 sample 更好\"。即使是 logprob（唯一的 per-sample signal）\n      在 NER 上也因为 greedy decode 已经 near-optimal 而无法提供增益。\n      Oracle headroom 巨大（NER +15.1pp，RE +18.7pp）但没有任何 signal 能 exploit 它。\n      RE 上 logprob 是唯一击败 greedy 的 signal（+2.3pp），验证了 per-sample vs instance-level\n      的区分，但 reviewer 的评价是：\"this distinction is well-known in the calibration literature;\n      the authors are re-discovering that aggregate confidence ≠ per-item ranking.\"\n      CoNLL 上所有 signal 都低于 greedy（headroom 仅 3.2pp），进一步确认 ceiling effect。\n    tables:\n      - table_id: T-006-1\n        caption: \"Best-of-N selection F1 (N=8/16, all datasets)\"\n        columns: [Dataset, Task, Greedy, Random, SJ, Logprob, Voting, Oracle]\n        rows:\n          - [SciERC, NER, 0.618, 0.586, 0.604, 0.609, 0.596, 0.769]\n          - [SciERC, RE, 0.374, 0.338, 0.368, 0.397, 0.338, 0.561]\n          - [CoNLL, NER, 0.725, 0.692, 0.718, 0.716, 0.714, 0.757]\n      - table_id: T-006-2\n        caption: \"F1 gain over greedy (pp)\"\n        columns: [Signal, SciERC-NER, SciERC-RE, CoNLL-NER, \"Cost (vs greedy)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Log-prob, \"−0.9\", \"+2.3\", \"−0.9\", \"0× extra\"]\n          - [Soft Jaccard, \"−1.4\", \"−0.6\", \"−0.7\", \"8× inference\"]\n          - [Voting conf, \"−2.2\", \"−3.6\", \"−1.1\", \"8× inference\"]\n          - [Ensemble, \"−1.4\", \"−0.7\", \"—\", \"8× + logprob\"]\n          - [Oracle, \"+15.1\", \"+18.7\", \"+3.2\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Fig-006-1: Selection curves — N vs F1 on SciERC NER，\n        greedy 虚线在所有 signal 之上，oracle 远上方，\n        所有 selection curves 在 greedy 下方是最有视觉冲击力的结果\n      - >\n        Fig-006-2: Cost-effectiveness scatter — x=inference cost, y=ΔF1 vs greedy，\n        所有 consistency signals 在第四象限（高 cost，负 gain），\n        logprob 在 (1×, −0.9) 位置——even logprob doesn't help for NER\n    analysis: >\n      Best-of-N 结果是 worst 档的 headline finding，也是 reviewer 最关注的：\n      \"NER best-of-N 全部 ≤ greedy\" 被解读为 \"the method fundamentally doesn't work\"。\n      即使 reframe 为 correlation-selection gap analysis，reviewer 仍会说\n      \"the paper identifies a gap but offers no solution — purely diagnostic with no\n      positive outcome.\" Oracle gap 的巨大（+15pp NER, +19pp RE）同时是好消息（headroom exists）\n      和坏消息（current signals waste 100% of it on NER）。RE 上 logprob 的成功（+2.3pp）\n      反而削弱了 consistency signals——\"if you want selection, just use logprob.\"\n\n  - name: ner_multi_model\n    plan_id: exp-007\n    description: >\n      LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct 在 SciERC NER/RE 上 fine-tune + inference。\n      Model-agnostic 验证。\n    expected_results:\n      llama_ner_greedy_f1: 0.660\n      llama_ner_oracle_f1: 0.781\n      llama_ner_headroom: 0.121\n      llama_ner_sj_rho: 0.36\n      llama_ner_fk_rho: 0.33\n      llama_ner_logprob_rho: 0.30\n      llama_ner_sj_auroc: 0.68\n      llama_ner_logprob_auroc: 0.62\n      llama_ner_sj_minus_logprob_rho: 0.06\n      llama_re_greedy_f1: 0.434\n      llama_re_sj_rho: 0.30\n      llama_re_fk_rho: 0.31\n      llama_re_logprob_rho: 0.29\n      llama_re_sj_cond_rho: 0.41\n      llama_re_logprob_cond_rho: 0.09\n      llama_ner_sample_f1_pct_zero: 11.6\n      llama_re_sample_f1_pct_zero: 41.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      LLaMA 上 SJ ρ=0.36 与 Qwen3 的 0.36 持平——表面看 model-agnostic，\n      但 worst 档的问题在于 logprob 在 LLaMA 上更弱（ρ=0.30 vs Qwen3 0.33），\n      使得 SJ-logprob gap 在 LLaMA 上稍大（+0.06）但在 Qwen3 上仅 +0.03。\n      Reviewer 会指出：\"the SJ advantage depends on which model you test —\n      on Qwen3 it's +0.03 (not significant), on LLaMA it's +0.06 (marginal).\n      This is not a robust model-agnostic finding.\"\n      RE 上 LLaMA 的 41.2% F1=0 进一步证实了 RE 的 difficulty boundary。\n      LLaMA RE cond SJ ρ=0.41 是一个亮点，但需要 conditional filtering 来展示，\n      而且只在 LLaMA×SciERC 这一个配置上出现。\n    tables:\n      - table_id: T-007-1\n        caption: \"Cross-model comparison: Qwen3-8B vs LLaMA-3.1-8B (SciERC)\"\n        columns: [Signal, Qwen3 NER ρ, LLaMA NER ρ, Δ, Qwen3 RE ρ, LLaMA RE ρ, Δ]\n        rows:\n          - [Soft Jaccard, 0.36, 0.36, 0.00, 0.21, 0.30, \"+0.09\"]\n          - [Log-prob, 0.33, 0.30, \"−0.03\", 0.25, 0.29, \"+0.04\"]\n          - [Voting conf, 0.37, 0.35, \"−0.02\", 0.30, 0.28, \"−0.02\"]\n          - [Fleiss' κ, 0.27, 0.33, \"+0.06\", 0.25, 0.31, \"+0.06\"]\n          - [Exact-match, 0.26, 0.24, \"−0.02\", 0.10, 0.08, \"−0.02\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Fig-007-1: 双模型 bar chart — SJ vs logprob gap 在 Qwen3 和 LLaMA 上方向一致\n        但幅度不稳定（+0.03 vs +0.06），reviewer 关注 instability\n    analysis: >\n      LLaMA 实验的 worst 档解读：model-agnostic 声称依赖于 2 个 8B 模型，\n      reviewer 认为 \"2 models from the same parameter scale is not sufficient for\n      model-agnostic claims — need at least one 70B+ model.\"\n      SJ-logprob gap 的跨模型 variance（+0.03 到 +0.06）被视为 instability。\n      RE 上 SJ 在 LLaMA 上反而比 Qwen3 好（0.30 vs 0.21），但这只是因为 LLaMA 的\n      RE greedy F1 更高（0.434 vs 0.374），更多 instance 进入 \"capability range\"。\n\n  - name: re_n16_confirmation\n    plan_id: exp-008\n    description: >\n      RE N=16 on SciERC，确认 RE negative finding 在更高 N 下仍成立。\n    expected_results:\n      re_sj_rho_n16_full: 0.28\n      re_sj_rho_n16_cond: 0.35\n      re_fk_rho_n16: 0.24\n      re_logprob_rho_n16: 0.30\n      re_voting_rho_n16: 0.32\n      re_n16_vs_n8_sj_delta: 0.07\n      re_oracle_f1_n16: 0.67\n      re_greedy_f1: 0.434\n      re_headroom_n16: 0.236\n      re_sample_f1_pct_zero: 44.3\n      ner_sj_rho_n16: 0.38\n      ner_logprob_rho_n16: 0.33\n    result_rationale: >\n      RE N=16 SJ ρ 从 N=8 的 0.21 升到 0.28（Δ=+0.07），但仍远低于 NER 的 0.38。\n      Worst 档的解读：RE 的改善来自更多 sample 平均了 compound error noise，\n      但 reviewer 会说 \"even at N=16 (doubling compute), RE SJ ρ=0.28 is still\n      well below the NER level — the task-complexity boundary is real and not fixable\n      by more sampling.\" Logprob N=16 ρ=0.30 再次与 SJ 持平或微超。\n      44.3% F1=0 sample 说明 RE 的知识缺口不是 sampling 能解决的。\n      Oracle headroom 从 0.17 升到 0.24 但 selection 仍无法利用。\n    tables:\n      - table_id: T-008-1\n        caption: \"RE N-scaling: N=8 vs N=16 (SciERC)\"\n        columns: [Signal, \"Full ρ@N=8\", \"Full ρ@N=16\", Δ, \"Cond ρ@N=16\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Soft Jaccard, 0.21, 0.28, \"+0.07\", 0.35]\n          - [Voting conf, 0.30, 0.32, \"+0.02\", 0.38]\n          - [Log-prob, 0.25, 0.30, \"+0.05\", 0.27]\n          - [Fleiss' κ, 0.25, 0.24, \"−0.01\", 0.30]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      N=16 RE 的微弱改善在 worst 档下不足以改变结论。Reviewer 说：\n      \"Increasing N from 8 to 16 yields +0.07 ρ for SJ but SJ still underperforms\n      logprob at N=16 (0.28 vs 0.30). The computational cost doubles for negligible gain.\"\n      这个实验是 confirmatory negative——排除了 \"N=8 不够\" 的 excuse。\n\n  - name: capability_stratification\n    plan_id: exp-009\n    description: >\n      按 difficulty strata (greedy F1 buckets + 独立 proxy: sentence length, entity count)\n      分析各 signal 的 ρ 变化。\n    expected_results:\n      scierc_ner:\n        by_greedy_f1:\n          hard_0_25_sj_rho: 0.16\n          med_low_sj_rho: 0.14\n          med_high_sj_rho: 0.09\n          easy_sj_rho: 0.23\n        by_sent_len:\n          Q1_sj_rho: 0.35\n          Q2_sj_rho: 0.32\n          Q3_sj_rho: 0.25\n          Q4_sj_rho: 0.30\n        by_ent_count:\n          zero_sj_rho: 0.52\n          one_two_sj_rho: 0.33\n          three_five_sj_rho: 0.28\n          six_plus_sj_rho: 0.40\n        overall_sj_rho: 0.36\n      scierc_re:\n        by_greedy_f1:\n          hard_sj_rho: -0.04\n          easy_sj_rho: 0.18\n      conll_ner:\n        by_sent_len:\n          Q1_sj_rho: 0.28\n          Q3_sj_rho: 0.38\n      proxy_independence:\n        f1_vs_slen: -0.02\n        f1_vs_ecnt: 0.01\n      inverted_u_confirmed: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档下 inverted-U 假说未被确认：按 greedy F1 bucket 分层后 ρ 没有清晰的\n      中间峰值（med_low=0.14, med_high=0.09 都低于 easy=0.23）。\n      Reviewer 评论：\"the authors claim a task-complexity boundary but the stratification\n      data doesn't show a clean inverted-U — the pattern is noisy and inconsistent.\"\n      用独立 proxy（sentence length）分层后 pattern 更模糊。\n      RE 上 hard bucket SJ ρ=−0.04 是直接 negative——SJ 在困难 RE 实例上是 anti-correlated。\n      Entity count=0 的高 ρ（0.52）是因为 trivially correct（无 entity 要提取），\n      reviewer 会说这 inflates the overall ρ。\n    tables:\n      - table_id: T-009-1\n        caption: \"Stratified ρ by difficulty (SciERC NER)\"\n        columns: [Stratum, n, SJ ρ, Logprob ρ, FK ρ]\n        rows:\n          - [\"F1 0-25%\", 105, 0.16, 0.20, 0.10]\n          - [\"F1 25-50%\", 63, 0.14, 0.18, 0.12]\n          - [\"F1 50-75%\", 142, 0.09, 0.15, 0.08]\n          - [\"F1 75-100%\", 130, 0.23, 0.28, 0.18]\n          - [\"Sent len Q1\", 140, 0.35, 0.30, 0.26]\n          - [\"Sent len Q4\", 132, 0.30, 0.28, 0.22]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Fig-009-1: Scatter — F1 bucket vs ρ，无清晰 inverted-U，\n        散点 noisy 且 logprob 在每个 bucket 都接近或超过 SJ\n    analysis: >\n      Stratification 分析在 worst 档下失败——没有产出 clean diagnostic insight。\n      Reviewer 的 major weakness：\"The diagnostic framework claims to identify\n      capability boundaries but the stratification evidence is weak and inconsistent.\n      This is descriptive, not prescriptive — the paper doesn't tell practitioners\n      anything actionable.\" 这直接对应 R17 (\"diagnostic framework overclaimed\")。\n\n  - name: selection_curves\n    plan_id: exp-010\n    description: >\n      Best-of-N selection curves (N=1,2,4,8,16) 可视化为 line plots。\n    expected_results:\n      scierc_ner:\n        N4: {oracle: 0.714, sj: 0.607, logprob: 0.616, voting: 0.594}\n        N8: {oracle: 0.752, sj: 0.604, logprob: 0.609, voting: 0.591}\n        N16: {oracle: 0.787, sj: 0.606, logprob: 0.612, voting: 0.585}\n        greedy: 0.618\n      scierc_re:\n        N8: {oracle: 0.583, sj: 0.368, logprob: 0.397, voting: 0.338}\n        N16: {oracle: 0.631, sj: 0.372, logprob: 0.405, voting: 0.340}\n        greedy: 0.374\n      conll_ner:\n        N4: {oracle: 0.746, sj: 0.714, logprob: 0.715}\n        N8: {oracle: 0.757, sj: 0.718, logprob: 0.716}\n        greedy: 0.725\n    result_rationale: >\n      Selection curves 在 worst 档下产出了最具视觉冲击力的 negative result：\n      SciERC NER 上所有 signal curves 在 greedy 虚线 BELOW——oracle curve 持续上升到 0.787\n      但所有实际 selection 停留在 0.60-0.61。N 从 4→16 增加时 oracle 持续改善但 selection 不动。\n      Greedy 虚线高高在上（0.618）说明不采样反而更好。\n      CoNLL 上 greedy=0.725 同样高于所有 selection（0.714-0.718），headroom 仅 3.2pp\n      且无法被利用。RE 上 logprob curve 是唯一在 greedy 之上的线（+2.3pp at N=16），\n      其余 signal 全部在 greedy 以下。这幅图本身就是 \"self-consistency doesn't work for IE\"\n      的最直接可视化证据。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Fig-010-1: 3-panel line plot (SciERC NER / SciERC RE / CoNLL NER)，\n        每 panel: x=N, y=F1，lines=Oracle/Greedy/各signal/Random。\n        NER panels 中 greedy 水平虚线在所有 signal 之上。\n        RE panel 中仅 logprob 穿过 greedy。\n        Oracle 和 selection 间的 fan-out 是 correlation-selection gap 的直接可视化。\n    analysis: >\n      Selection curves 是 paper 的 Figure 1 候选——最直观地展示了\n      correlation-selection gap：oracle 证明 headroom 存在，\n      但所有 signal 在 greedy 下方说明 current signals 无法 exploit 它。\n      在 worst 档下 reviewer 的评价是：\"Fig 1 is interesting but the paper\n      doesn't offer any solution — it identifies a problem and stops.\"\n\n  - name: ner_ood_robustness\n    plan_id: exp-011\n    description: >\n      NER consistency signal 在 OOD 实例上的表现（SciERC fine-tuned 模型 on WNUT data）。\n    expected_results:\n      ood_sj_rho: 0.05\n      ood_logprob_rho: 0.15\n      ood_fk_rho: 0.03\n      ood_voting_rho: 0.06\n      ood_greedy_f1: 0.28\n      ood_sample_f1_pct_zero: 62.4\n      ood_mean_sj: 0.38\n      ood_sj_auroc: 0.52\n      ood_logprob_auroc: 0.58\n      ood_degradation_sj: -0.31\n      ood_degradation_logprob: -0.18\n    result_rationale: >\n      OOD 场景下所有 signal 几乎崩溃：SJ ρ=0.05（与 0 无显著差异），\n      logprob ρ=0.15（微弱但存在）。62.4% sample F1=0 说明模型在 OOD 域上\n      大量 hallucinate。SJ 退化幅度（−0.31）远大于 logprob（−0.18），\n      原因：OOD hallucination 可以是 consistent（模型反复产出同一错误 entity set），\n      导致高 SJ 但低 F1（hallucination consistency）。Logprob 在 OOD 时天然偏低，\n      保持了弱单调关系。这在 worst 档下是 \"SJ 在 OOD 上完全失效\" 的证据，\n      但 paper 可能不会报告这个实验（P2 priority）。如果 reviewer 推断其存在\n      会进一步削弱 generalization 主张。\n    tables:\n      - table_id: T-011-1\n        caption: \"In-domain vs OOD signal quality (SciERC model → WNUT data)\"\n        columns: [Signal, \"In-domain ρ\", \"OOD ρ\", Degradation]\n        rows:\n          - [Log-prob, 0.33, 0.15, \"−0.18\"]\n          - [Soft Jaccard, 0.36, 0.05, \"−0.31\"]\n          - [Voting conf, 0.37, 0.06, \"−0.31\"]\n          - [Fleiss' κ, 0.27, 0.03, \"−0.24\"]\n          - [Exact-match, 0.26, 0.04, \"−0.22\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      P2 实验。OOD 退化符合预期但在 worst 档下如果被 reviewer 追问\n      会成为致命弱点。SJ 的 hallucination consistency failure mode\n      是 consistency-based methods 的根本局限性，但 paper 若不主动报告\n      反而显得在回避。\n\n  - name: signal_ensemble_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-016\n    description: >\n      SJ+logprob 相关性分析、线性组合搜索、logistic regression 集成、\n      Best-of-N ensemble selection。\n    expected_results:\n      sj_logprob_pearson_ner: 0.55\n      sj_logprob_pearson_re: 0.40\n      best_linear_ner:\n        combo: SJ+voting_conf\n        alpha: 0.35\n        rho: 0.39\n      best_linear_re:\n        combo: voting_conf+logprob\n        alpha: 0.55\n        rho: 0.33\n      ensemble_ner_auroc: 0.70\n      ensemble_re_auroc: 0.66\n      best_single_ner_auroc: 0.68\n      best_single_re_auroc: 0.64\n      ensemble_ner_delta_auroc: 0.02\n      ensemble_re_delta_auroc: 0.02\n      selection_f1_ner:\n        greedy: 0.618\n        logprob: 0.609\n        sj: 0.604\n        ensemble: 0.606\n        voting: 0.596\n        random: 0.580\n        oracle: 0.769\n      selection_f1_re:\n        logprob: 0.397\n        greedy: 0.374\n        sj: 0.368\n        ensemble: 0.375\n        voting: 0.338\n        random: 0.338\n        oracle: 0.561\n      fk_negative_weight: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Ensemble 的 AUROC 提升仅 +0.02 on NER（0.70 vs best single 0.68），\n      RE 上同样 +0.02。线性组合 best ρ=0.39 仅比 best single(voting 0.37) 高 +0.02。\n      Worst 档的关键：ensemble 没有 meaningful 提升，说明各 signal 高度冗余——\n      它们编码了相似的信息（SJ-logprob Pearson=0.55 证实了这一点）。\n      FK 在 logistic regression 中权重为负——surface agreement 在 structural signals\n      存在时是 net-negative（noisy proxy 被 structural signal dominated）。\n      Best-of-N ensemble selection 同样 ≤ greedy on NER（0.606 < 0.618），\n      RE 上 ensemble(0.375) ≈ greedy(0.374) but < logprob alone(0.397)。\n      Reviewer 评论：\"even combining all signals doesn't help —\n      the correlation-selection gap is fundamental, not fixable by ensembling.\"\n    tables:\n      - table_id: T-016-1\n        caption: \"Signal ensemble analysis (SciERC)\"\n        columns: [Metric, Best Single, Ensemble, Δ]\n        rows:\n          - [NER AUROC, \"0.68 (voting)\", 0.70, \"+0.02\"]\n          - [NER ρ, \"0.37 (voting)\", \"0.39 (SJ+voting α=0.35)\", \"+0.02\"]\n          - [RE AUROC, \"0.64 (voting)\", 0.66, \"+0.02\"]\n          - [RE ρ, \"0.30 (voting)\", \"0.33 (voting+logprob α=0.55)\", \"+0.03\"]\n      - table_id: T-016-2\n        caption: \"Best-of-N selection: ensemble vs individual\"\n        columns: [Signal, NER F1, RE F1]\n        rows:\n          - [Greedy, 0.618, 0.374]\n          - [Logprob, 0.609, 0.397]\n          - [SJ, 0.604, 0.368]\n          - [Ensemble, 0.606, 0.375]\n          - [Voting, 0.596, 0.338]\n          - [Oracle, 0.769, 0.561]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Fig-016-1: Heatmap — logistic regression 系数，FK 为负值（红色），\n        SJ 和 voting 正值接近，logprob 正值中等\n    analysis: >\n      Ensemble 分析回答了 Dream 2 reviewer 的问题但答案是负面的：\n      组合 signal 不产生 meaningful improvement。这支持了 worst 档叙事：\n      \"信号间高度冗余，correlation-selection gap 不是信号不足的问题，\n      而是 instance-level metrics 的结构性局限。\" 但 reviewer 会将此解读为\n      \"insufficient methodological contribution — the paper proposes nothing new.\"\n\n  - name: ner_llama_conll\n    plan_id: exp-017\n    description: >\n      LLaMA-3.1-8B 在 CoNLL-2003 上 fine-tune + inference，\n      扩展 cross-model × cross-dataset validation matrix。\n    expected_results:\n      greedy_f1: 0.924\n      oracle_f1: 0.945\n      oracle_headroom: 0.021\n      n_valid: 2756\n      full:\n        SJ_rho: 0.34\n        FK_rho: 0.33\n        logprob_rho: 0.31\n        EM_rho: 0.34\n        voting_rho: 0.33\n        SJ_AUROC: 0.68\n        logprob_AUROC: 0.66\n      conditional:\n        SJ_rho: 0.35\n        logprob_rho: 0.33\n      sj_minus_logprob_rho: 0.03\n      sj_minus_logprob_auroc: 0.02\n      best_of_n:\n        greedy: 0.924\n        sj_best: 0.920\n        logprob_best: 0.921\n        voting_best: 0.919\n        oracle: 0.945\n      structural_beats_logprob: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      LLaMA×CoNLL 是 2×2 matrix 的最后一个 cell。SJ ρ=0.34 与 Qwen3×CoNLL(0.34)\n      完全一致——structural signal 在 CoNLL 上 model-agnostic（好消息），\n      但 gap vs logprob 仅 +0.03（坏消息）。Greedy F1=0.924 极高（CoNLL 对 LLaMA 很容易），\n      headroom 仅 0.021，best-of-N 所有 signal ≤ greedy（SJ 0.920 < 0.924）。\n      AUROC gap +0.02 在 n=2756 下虽然统计显著但 practical significance 微弱。\n      Worst 档下 reviewer 看到这个结果会说：\"the 2×2 matrix is commendable for rigor,\n      but it confirms that on standard NER, the structural advantage is negligible (+0.02-0.03),\n      and selection never works.\" LLaMA×CoNLL 加入后 cross_config_structural_gt_logprob_rate\n      升到 ~0.70（7/10 configs），但 gap median 仅 +0.03。\n    tables:\n      - table_id: T-017-1\n        caption: \"LLaMA × CoNLL-2003 NER (N=8, T=1.0, n=2756)\"\n        columns: [Signal, \"ρ (full)\", AUROC, \"ρ (cond)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Soft Jaccard, 0.34, 0.68, 0.35]\n          - [Exact-match, 0.34, 0.70, 0.36]\n          - [Voting conf, 0.33, 0.67, 0.34]\n          - [Fleiss' κ, 0.33, 0.66, 0.34]\n          - [Log-prob, 0.31, 0.66, 0.33]\n      - table_id: T-017-2\n        caption: \"2×2 cross-validation matrix summary (NER, SJ ρ full)\"\n        columns: [\" \", Qwen3-8B, LLaMA-3.1-8B]\n        rows:\n          - [SciERC, 0.36, 0.36]\n          - [CoNLL, 0.34, 0.34]\n      - table_id: T-017-3\n        caption: \"2×2 matrix: SJ − Logprob Δρ\"\n        columns: [\" \", Qwen3-8B, LLaMA-3.1-8B]\n        rows:\n          - [SciERC, \"+0.03\", \"+0.06\"]\n          - [CoNLL, \"+0.02\", \"+0.03\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Fig-017-1: 2×2 heatmap — SJ ρ 值，所有 cell 在 0.34-0.36 之间，\n        cross-model×dataset consistency 很高但绝对值不突出\n    analysis: >\n      2×2 matrix 在 worst 档下的价值是双面的：它证明了 robustness（SJ ρ 在 0.34-0.36 \n      跨 model/dataset 一致），但也证明了 mediocrity（gap vs logprob 始终仅 +0.02-0.06，\n      从未达到让 reviewer 说 \"this is meaningful\" 的水平）。\n      Reviewer 总结：\"the authors show a consistent but tiny advantage of structural signals,\n      which does not justify the 8× inference cost nor constitute a sufficient contribution\n      for a main conference paper.\" 这直接导致 R4+R19 的 rejection rationale。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":31541,"cache_read_input_tokens":56191,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":31541},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"be60cc2d-21a9-4d86-8473-16b9efb6edfb","uuid":"298e829f-d8cb-4032-bae4-7447cb55f6c2"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":512015,"duration_api_ms":513222,"num_turns":12,"result":"Now I have the full context — the experiment plan, registry data, previous worst-tier dreams, and the Phase 1 worst-tier definition. Let me generate the detailed imagined experiments.\n\n```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  完全 reframe 为 'Why Self-Consistency Fails for Structured Prediction: An Analysis of the Correlation-Selection Gap'。\n  在这个档位下，structural signals 对 logprob 的优势微弱到不具实际意义（AUROC gap 0-5pp，ρ gap -4 to +5 hundredths），\n  reviewer 将 paper 定性为 negative result 但 novelty 不足。Nédellec & Xia 2026 被视为 scooping——\n  他们已经做了 consistency-accuracy 相关性研究，我们的 structural metrics 被视为 minor extension。\n  Correlation-selection gap 被 dismiss 为 'obvious: instance-level ≠ sample-level is well-known in calibration literature'。\n  NER best-of-N 全部 ≤ greedy 被解读为 the method fundamentally doesn't work。\n  WNUT abandoned 被推断为 cherry-picking datasets。Paper 的唯一存活 claim 是 quality estimation 中\n  structural > logprob 在 60-80% 的配置上成立但 gap 太小，不足以 justify venue contribution。\n  Lead with negative finding + explanation 策略本身被 reviewer 视为 post-hoc rationalization。\n  目标从 Main 降为 Findings，但 Findings 概率也仅 15-35%。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: baseline_logprob\n    plan_id: exp-012\n    description: >\n      对所有 pilot 数据 (SciERC NER+RE) 提取 sequence log-probability，\n      计算与 F1 的 Spearman ρ、AUROC、Kendall τ。\n    expected_results:\n      scierc_ner_logprob_rho: 0.33\n      scierc_ner_logprob_auroc: 0.64\n      scierc_ner_logprob_tau: 0.24\n      scierc_ner_logprob_ece: 0.09\n      scierc_ner_sj_rho: 0.36\n      scierc_ner_sj_auroc: 0.67\n      scierc_ner_sj_minus_logprob_rho: 0.03\n      scierc_ner_sj_minus_logprob_auroc: 0.03\n      scierc_ner_fk_rho: 0.27\n      scierc_ner_greedy_logprob_rho: 0.34\n      scierc_re_logprob_rho: 0.25\n      scierc_re_logprob_auroc: 0.62\n      scierc_re_sj_rho: 0.21\n      scierc_re_sj_auroc: 0.59\n      scierc_re_cond_logprob_rho: 0.19\n      scierc_re_cond_sj_rho: 0.33\n      scierc_re_cond_sj_auroc: 0.65\n      n_ner: 529\n      n_re: 397\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档的关键：logprob 在 NER 上与 SJ 差距仅 Δρ=0.03、ΔAUROC=0.03，\n      统计上 bootstrap CI 重叠。原理——fine-tuned 8B 模型的 softmax 已 well-calibrated，\n      logprob 隐式编码了 entity span 正确性的全部信息。SJ 的额外 8 次采样只带来 +0.03 ρ 的微弱增益，\n      reviewer 认为这不 justify 8x 推理成本。更致命的是 greedy_logprob（单次前向传播的 logprob）\n      ρ=0.34 实际上已经超过 SJ 的 ρ=0.36 的下界 CI。RE 上 logprob full ρ=0.25 > SJ full ρ=0.21，\n      虽然 RE cond 上 SJ 反超（0.33 vs 0.19），但 reviewer 将 conditional 分析视为 cherry-picking。\n      整体结论：SJ 对 logprob 的优势在 NER 上 marginal，在 RE full 上不存在。\n    tables:\n      - table_id: T-012-1\n        caption: \"Confidence signal comparison: log-probability vs structural signals (Spearman ρ with F1)\"\n        columns: [Dataset, Task, Log-prob ρ, SJ ρ, FK ρ, \"Δ(SJ−LP)\", \"p(Δ)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [SciERC, NER-full, 0.33, 0.36, 0.27, \"+0.03\", 0.14]\n          - [SciERC, NER-cond, 0.30, 0.37, 0.28, \"+0.07\", 0.04]\n          - [SciERC, RE-full, 0.25, 0.21, 0.25, \"−0.04\", 0.32]\n          - [SciERC, RE-cond, 0.19, 0.33, 0.28, \"+0.14\", 0.002]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Fig-012-1: Scatter plot 双联——log-prob vs F1 (left) 和 SJ vs F1 (right)，\n        SciERC NER，两者 spread 几乎一样，SJ 的 regression line 斜率仅微高于 logprob，\n        reviewer 第一眼看不出明显差别\n    analysis: >\n      Worst 档下 exp-012 的结果不是灾难性的——SJ 仍然在 NER 上微弱领先——但差距小到\n      reviewer 可以 legitimately argue \"this is not practically significant\"。\n      特别是 Δρ=0.03 在 n=529 下 p=0.14 不显著。RE full 上 logprob > SJ 给了 reviewer\n      弹药：\"SJ 在 RE 上甚至不如 logprob\"。唯一亮点是 RE cond 上 SJ 明确领先（+0.14），\n      但这需要 conditional filtering 来展示，削弱了 generality。\n      核心问题：reviewer 会说 \"so SJ is marginally better in some settings and worse in others —\n      this is a wash, not a contribution.\"\n\n  - name: baseline_exact_match\n    plan_id: exp-013\n    description: >\n      Exact-match voting rate：N 个 sample 中完全相同 entity/relation set 的比例，\n      与 F1 计算 ρ/AUROC/τ。Wang et al. 2023 self-consistency 的直接结构化推广。\n    expected_results:\n      scierc_ner_em_rho: 0.26\n      scierc_ner_em_auroc: 0.62\n      scierc_ner_em_tau: 0.19\n      scierc_re_em_rho: 0.10\n      scierc_re_em_auroc: 0.50\n      scierc_re_em_tau: 0.08\n      scierc_ner_pct_all_match: 9.1\n      scierc_ner_pct_no_match: 38.7\n      scierc_re_pct_all_match: 1.8\n      scierc_re_pct_no_match: 68.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      EM 在 NER ρ=0.26 低于 SJ(0.36) 和 logprob(0.33)，在 RE ρ=0.10 是所有 signal 中最弱。\n      这符合预期——IE 输出的 surface form 变异（span boundary 差异、entity 排列顺序差异）\n      使得 exact-match 信号极度稀疏（39% NER 样本无任何 EM pair）。但在 worst 档下这个结果\n      反而削弱了 SJ 的叙事：reviewer 会说 \"SJ 比 EM 好 only because EM is a strawman —\n      the real comparison is with logprob, which is free and equally good.\"\n      RE 上 EM AUROC=0.50 等同于随机，证明 exact-match 在 relation extraction 上完全失效。\n    tables:\n      - table_id: T-013-1\n        caption: \"Exact-match voting rate distribution and correlation\"\n        columns: [Dataset, Task, \"% all-match\", \"% no-match\", \"ρ with F1\", AUROC]\n        rows:\n          - [SciERC, NER, 9.1, 38.7, 0.26, 0.62]\n          - [SciERC, RE, 1.8, 68.2, 0.10, 0.50]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Fig-013-1: Histogram — EM rate 分布（0/8, 1/8, ..., 8/8），\n        高度集中于 0 和 1，几乎二值化的粗粒度信号\n    analysis: >\n      EM 是 self-consistency 在结构化输出上的 naïve baseline，其弱势是意料之中的。\n      在 worst 档下，这个实验的价值被 reviewer 低估——他们认为 \"of course exact-match\n      doesn't work for structured outputs, this is obvious\" 而不是将其视为\n      motivation for SJ。结果是 SJ > EM 这个子结论被视为 trivial。\n\n  - name: baseline_entity_voting\n    plan_id: exp-014\n    description: >\n      Entity-level majority voting confidence：对每个 entity 统计在 N 个 sample 中的出现频率，\n      计算 instance-level 平均 voting confidence 与 F1 的相关性。\n    expected_results:\n      scierc_ner_voting_rho: 0.37\n      scierc_ner_voting_auroc: 0.68\n      scierc_ner_voting_tau: 0.27\n      scierc_re_voting_rho: 0.30\n      scierc_re_voting_auroc: 0.64\n      scierc_re_voting_tau: 0.22\n      scierc_ner_voting_f1_selected: 0.615\n      scierc_ner_greedy_f1: 0.648\n      scierc_ner_oracle_f1: 0.779\n      scierc_ner_voting_vs_greedy_delta: -3.3\n      scierc_re_voting_f1_selected: 0.358\n      scierc_re_greedy_f1: 0.402\n      voting_minus_sj_ner_rho: 0.01\n      voting_minus_logprob_ner_rho: 0.04\n    result_rationale: >\n      Entity voting ρ=0.37 在 NER 上与 SJ(0.36) 几乎持平（Δ=+0.01），AUROC 也仅微弱领先（0.68 vs 0.67）。\n      关键是 voting vs logprob 差距也很小（+0.04 ρ）。在 worst 档下三者（voting, SJ, logprob）\n      形成一个统计上无法区分的 cluster（bootstrap CI 大量重叠），reviewer 会说\n      \"all signals perform similarly — the choice of signal doesn't matter.\"\n      Voting 作为 selection strategy（而非 quality estimation）失败得更彻底：\n      voting-selected F1=0.615 低于 greedy=0.648（−3.3pp），因为 majority vote\n      倾向于选择\"平庸但安全\"的 entity 而丢弃正确但少数的 entity。\n      RE 上 voting ρ=0.30 高于 SJ(0.21) 但仍低于 logprob 的下界期望。\n    tables:\n      - table_id: T-014-1\n        caption: \"Entity voting vs other signals (SciERC)\"\n        columns: [Signal, NER ρ, NER AUROC, RE ρ, RE AUROC]\n        rows:\n          - [Voting conf, 0.37, 0.68, 0.30, 0.64]\n          - [Soft Jaccard, 0.36, 0.67, 0.21, 0.59]\n          - [Log-prob, 0.33, 0.64, 0.25, 0.62]\n          - [Fleiss' κ, 0.27, 0.59, 0.25, 0.61]\n          - [Exact-match, 0.26, 0.62, 0.10, 0.50]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Fig-014-1: Bar chart — 5 signal 在 NER 上的 ρ，三者（voting/SJ/logprob）\n        高度接近，error bars 重叠，视觉上无明显优胜者\n    analysis: >\n      Entity voting 的加入没有改变整体叙事——在 worst 档下它只是 structural consistency\n      family 中另一个与 logprob 差距不大的 signal。Voting 作为 selection 策略失败\n      （低于 greedy -3.3pp）直接支持了 correlation-selection gap 的 narrative，\n      但 reviewer 认为这是 \"expected: instance-level aggregates can't rank individual samples.\"\n\n  - name: evaluation_metrics_expansion\n    plan_id: exp-015\n    description: >\n      在所有 confidence signal × 所有数据集上扩展评估指标：\n      AUROC、Kendall τ、ECE (calibration)。Leave-one-out SJ 检验评估 circularity。\n    expected_results:\n      scierc_ner:\n        voting_rho: 0.37\n        voting_auroc: 0.68\n        voting_tau: 0.27\n        sj_rho: 0.36\n        sj_auroc: 0.67\n        sj_tau: 0.26\n        sj_ece: 0.11\n        fk_rho: 0.27\n        fk_auroc: 0.59\n        fk_tau: 0.20\n        logprob_rho: 0.33\n        logprob_auroc: 0.64\n        logprob_tau: 0.24\n        logprob_ece: 0.08\n        em_rho: 0.26\n        em_auroc: 0.62\n        em_tau: 0.19\n        loo_sj_rho: 0.35\n        loo_sj_delta: -0.01\n        n_valid: 529\n        n_cond: 501\n      scierc_re:\n        voting_rho: 0.30\n        voting_auroc: 0.64\n        sj_rho: 0.21\n        sj_auroc: 0.59\n        logprob_rho: 0.25\n        logprob_auroc: 0.62\n        n_valid: 397\n        n_cond: 296\n      conll_ner:\n        sj_rho: 0.34\n        sj_auroc: 0.68\n        logprob_rho: 0.32\n        logprob_auroc: 0.66\n        voting_rho: 0.33\n        em_rho: 0.35\n      wnut_ner:\n        sj_rho: 0.08\n        sj_auroc: 0.55\n        logprob_rho: -0.41\n        fk_rho: 0.12\n    result_rationale: >\n      多指标扩展后的全景：AUROC gap (structural vs logprob) 在 NER 上仅 +0.03~0.04，\n      在 RE 上为负（-0.03）。ECE 上 logprob=0.08 优于 SJ=0.11，因为 logprob 天然是概率量。\n      Leave-one-out SJ ρ=0.35 vs full SJ ρ=0.36，Δ=-0.01，排除了 circularity concern，\n      但 reviewer 不会因此给加分（\"LOO 差异小是 expected, not a contribution\"）。\n      CoNLL 上 EM(0.35) > SJ(0.34) > voting(0.33) > logprob(0.32)，所有信号极接近，\n      因为 CoNLL 模型 F1 很高导致所有信号 ceiling-out。WNUT 上 SJ ρ=0.08 不显著，\n      logprob ρ=−0.41（反相关），所有 signal 失败——但 WNUT 被 abandoned，reviewer 若推断\n      这一点会进一步质疑 generalization。\n    tables:\n      - table_id: T-015-1\n        caption: \"Comprehensive 5-signal evaluation — SciERC NER (N=8, T=1.0)\"\n        columns: [Signal, \"ρ\", AUROC, \"τ\", ECE, \"LOO-ρ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Voting conf, 0.37, 0.68, 0.27, 0.10, \"—\"]\n          - [Soft Jaccard, 0.36, 0.67, 0.26, 0.11, 0.35]\n          - [Log-prob, 0.33, 0.64, 0.24, 0.08, \"—\"]\n          - [Fleiss' κ, 0.27, 0.59, 0.20, 0.14, \"—\"]\n          - [Exact-match, 0.26, 0.62, 0.19, 0.16, \"—\"]\n      - table_id: T-015-2\n        caption: \"Cross-dataset AUROC comparison\"\n        columns: [Signal, SciERC-NER, CoNLL-NER, WNUT-NER, SciERC-RE-full, SciERC-RE-cond]\n        rows:\n          - [Voting, 0.68, 0.67, 0.56, 0.64, 0.68]\n          - [SJ, 0.67, 0.68, 0.55, 0.59, 0.65]\n          - [Log-prob, 0.64, 0.66, 0.36, 0.62, 0.55]\n          - [FK, 0.59, 0.63, 0.54, 0.61, 0.58]\n          - [EM, 0.62, 0.70, 0.55, 0.50, 0.54]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Fig-015-1: Reliability diagram (calibration) — logprob 更贴合 y=x 对角线 (ECE=0.08)，\n        SJ 系统性偏高 (ECE=0.11)\n      - >\n        Fig-015-2: ROC curve — NER 上 voting 和 SJ 的 curve 仅微幅高于 logprob，\n        三条 curve 几乎重叠，bootstrap CI band 大量 overlap\n    analysis: >\n      多指标扩展的致命结果：所有指标都确认了 structural vs logprob 差距极小。\n      AUROC 差距 +0.03 比 ρ 差距 +0.03 没有更大——不存在 \"ρ understates the advantage\" 的反驳。\n      ECE 上 logprob 甚至更好。Reviewer 会指出：\"Table 2 shows that across 5 metrics,\n      logprob is competitive or better on 2 out of 5 — the claimed superiority of\n      structural signals is at best marginal.\" WNUT 数据如果被发现会是致命一击。\n\n  - name: ner_n16_scierc\n    plan_id: exp-001\n    description: >\n      SciERC NER N=16, T=1.0, ft_002_v2 模型, 3 seeds (42/123/456)。\n      测试 N-scaling 效应，采集 log-prob。\n    expected_results:\n      ner_sj_rho_n16_s42: 0.37\n      ner_sj_rho_n16_s123: 0.36\n      ner_sj_rho_n16_s456: 0.33\n      ner_sj_rho_n16_mean: 0.353\n      ner_sj_rho_n16_std: 0.021\n      ner_voting_rho_n16_mean: 0.36\n      ner_logprob_rho_n16_mean: 0.33\n      ner_fk_rho_n16_mean: 0.26\n      ner_em_rho_n16_mean: 0.30\n      ner_sj_rho_n8_mean: 0.36\n      ner_sj_rho_delta_n16_vs_n8: -0.007\n      ner_oracle_f1_n16: 0.81\n      ner_greedy_f1: 0.655\n      ner_headroom_n16: 0.155\n      re_sj_rho_n16: 0.27\n      re_logprob_rho_n16: 0.30\n      re_voting_rho_n16: 0.35\n      re_oracle_f1_n16: 0.67\n      re_sample_f1_pct_zero: 44.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      N=16 对 SJ ρ 无提升甚至微降（0.353 vs N=8 的 0.36，Δ=−0.007）。\n      Worst 档的逻辑：SJ 在 N=8 时已饱和——pairwise (N choose 2) 从 28 增到 120，\n      但额外 sample 高度冗余。Seed-to-seed 标准差 σ=0.021 说明 seed456 的低值（0.33）\n      不是噪声而是边界情况，reviewer 可能 cherry-pick 这个 seed 来论证 SJ 不 robust。\n      更关键的是 logprob（ρ=0.33）在 N=16 上与 SJ（0.353）差距仍仅 +0.02。\n      RE 上 N=16 SJ ρ=0.27 虽比 N=8 的 0.21 有提升，但 reviewer 会指出\n      \"even at N=16, RE SJ is still below 0.30 — the method doesn't work for RE.\"\n      Oracle F1 从 0.75 升到 0.81 但 SJ 选不出更好的候选——signal ceiling 明确。\n    tables:\n      - table_id: T-001-1\n        caption: \"N-scaling effect on confidence signals (SciERC, 3-seed mean)\"\n        columns: [Signal, \"ρ@N=8\", \"ρ@N=16\", \"Δ\", \"seed σ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Soft Jaccard, 0.36, 0.353, \"−0.007\", 0.021]\n          - [Voting conf, 0.37, 0.36, \"−0.01\", 0.018]\n          - [Log-prob, 0.33, 0.33, 0.00, \"—\"]\n          - [Fleiss' κ, 0.27, 0.26, \"−0.01\", 0.015]\n          - [Exact-match, 0.26, 0.30, \"+0.04\", 0.022]\n      - table_id: T-001-2\n        caption: \"Multi-seed robustness (SciERC NER N=16, SJ ρ)\"\n        columns: [Seed, NER ρ_SJ, NER ρ_logprob, RE ρ_SJ]\n        rows:\n          - [42, 0.37, 0.33, 0.27]\n          - [123, 0.36, 0.34, 0.26]\n          - [456, 0.33, 0.32, 0.27]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Fig-001-1: Line plot — N vs ρ (N=4,8,16)，SJ 在 N=8 后平坦或微降，\n        logprob 水平线几乎与 SJ 重叠\n      - >\n        Fig-001-2: 3-seed box plot — variance 小但 seed456 下拉 mean，\n        CI 与 logprob 完全 overlap\n    analysis: >\n      N=16 实验在 worst 档下是双重打击：(1) 更多 sample 不提升 SJ——\"N=8 不够\"假说被否定；\n      (2) seed-to-seed variance（0.33-0.37）覆盖了 logprob 的值域（0.32-0.34），\n      reviewer 结论：\"the two signals are statistically indistinguishable.\"\n      RE 的改善从 0.21 到 0.27 虽然存在，但仍远低于任何有意义的阈值。\n\n  - name: ner_conll2003\n    plan_id: exp-002\n    description: >\n      CoNLL-2003 上 fine-tune Qwen3-8B (LoRA) + NER (N=8, T=1.0)。\n      跨数据集泛化验证。\n    expected_results:\n      conll_greedy_f1: 0.907\n      conll_oracle_f1: 0.945\n      conll_headroom: 0.038\n      conll_sj_rho: 0.34\n      conll_sj_auroc: 0.68\n      conll_sj_tau: 0.30\n      conll_fk_rho: 0.31\n      conll_logprob_rho: 0.32\n      conll_logprob_auroc: 0.66\n      conll_em_rho: 0.35\n      conll_voting_rho: 0.33\n      conll_sj_minus_logprob: 0.02\n      conll_mean_sj: 0.86\n      conll_sample_f1_pct_zero: 2.8\n      n_valid: 2756\n    result_rationale: >\n      CoNLL 上 SJ ρ=0.34 仅比 logprob ρ=0.32 高 0.02，AUROC gap 同样仅 +0.02。\n      Worst 档的核心机制是 ceiling effect：greedy F1=0.907，mean SJ=0.86，\n      绝大多数 sample 已经很好（仅 2.8% F1=0），SJ 在高一致区域的 discriminative power 崩溃。\n      EM(0.35) 甚至微幅领先 SJ(0.34)——在 CoNLL 这种标准 NER 上 exact-match 反而\n      因为 entity 简单而足够有效，这直接削弱了 \"soft similarity is necessary\" 的论点。\n      Headroom 仅 0.038（oracle 94.5 vs greedy 90.7），best-of-N 几乎无空间。\n      Reviewer 会说：\"on CoNLL, all signals including exact-match perform similarly —\n      the structural metric adds no value for standard NER tasks.\"\n    tables:\n      - table_id: T-002-1\n        caption: \"CoNLL-2003 NER: all confidence signals (N=8, T=1.0, n=2756)\"\n        columns: [Signal, ρ, AUROC, τ, \"vs SciERC Δρ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Exact-match, 0.35, 0.70, 0.31, \"+0.09\"]\n          - [Soft Jaccard, 0.34, 0.68, 0.30, \"−0.02\"]\n          - [Voting conf, 0.33, 0.67, 0.29, \"−0.04\"]\n          - [Log-prob, 0.32, 0.66, 0.25, \"−0.01\"]\n          - [Fleiss' κ, 0.31, 0.63, 0.28, \"+0.04\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Fig-002-1: SJ 分布 histogram — 高度右偏集中于 0.85-1.0，\n        与 SciERC 更 spread-out 的分布并排对比，直观展示 ceiling effect\n    analysis: >\n      CoNLL 结果在 worst 档下暴露了 SJ 的 dataset sensitivity：在 \"easy\" NER 上\n      SJ 的优势消失（Δρ=+0.02）。更致命的是 EM 反超 SJ——\n      reviewer 会问：\"if exact-match works just as well on CoNLL, why do we need SJ?\"\n      这将被引用为 SJ 只在 SciERC 特有的 scientific entity 复杂度下有效的证据，\n      泛化性成疑。\n\n  - name: ner_wnut17\n    plan_id: exp-003\n    description: >\n      WNUT-17 (social media NER) fine-tune + inference。被 abandoned 但 data 存在。\n    expected_results:\n      wnut_greedy_f1: 0.525\n      wnut_oracle_f1: 0.664\n      wnut_headroom: 0.139\n      wnut_sj_rho_full: 0.08\n      wnut_sj_p: 0.12\n      wnut_fk_rho: 0.12\n      wnut_logprob_rho_full: -0.41\n      wnut_logprob_rho_cond: 0.35\n      wnut_sj_rho_cond: 0.28\n      wnut_sample_f1_pct_zero: 53.7\n      wnut_n_gold_empty: 598\n      wnut_n_instances: 1287\n      wnut_sj_auroc: 0.55\n      wnut_structural_beats_surface: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      WNUT 是 worst 档下的 smoking gun。SJ ρ=0.08 不显著（p=0.12），\n      53.7% 的 sample F1=0，598/1287 个 instance gold set 为空。\n      Logprob full ρ=−0.41（反相关！）说明模型在 noisy social media text 上\n      完全 uncalibrated——高 logprob 的 sample 反而更可能是 confident hallucination。\n      所有 signal 在 WNUT 上失败。虽然 paper 可以 abandon 并不报告，\n      但 reviewer 若问 \"why only 2 NER datasets?\" 或推断 WNUT 被排除，\n      会质疑 dataset cherry-picking。这是 worst 档假设的核心：\n      \"WNUT abandoned (>50% F1=0, structural rho not significant) 被发现或推断\"。\n    tables:\n      - table_id: T-003-1\n        caption: \"WNUT-17 NER results (abandoned — included for completeness)\"\n        columns: [Signal, Full ρ, Cond ρ, AUROC, Notes]\n        rows:\n          - [Soft Jaccard, 0.08, 0.28, 0.55, \"p=0.12, not significant\"]\n          - [Fleiss' κ, 0.12, 0.17, 0.54, \"\"]\n          - [Log-prob, \"−0.41\", 0.35, 0.36, \"full anti-correlated\"]\n          - [Exact-match, 0.09, 0.22, 0.53, \"\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      WNUT 被 abandoned 是正确决定——53.7% F1=0 意味着数据集超出模型能力范围。\n      但这在 worst 档下被解读为 \"generalization failure\"：paper 声称\n      structural consistency 是 universal quality estimator，\n      但在 social media domain 上甚至不 significant。\n      Reviewer 会在 weaknesses 中写：\"The authors only report results on 2 NER datasets,\n      both with relatively clean text. Applicability to noisy domains is unknown.\"\n\n  - name: re_diagnostic_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-004\n    description: >\n      RE per-relation-type 分解、bootstrap CI、threshold sensitivity、error propagation。\n    expected_results:\n      per_relation_type:\n        HYPONYM-OF: {n: 36, rho_sj: 0.38, rho_fk: 0.45, rho_logprob: 0.42}\n        CONJUNCTION: {n: 86, rho_sj: 0.28, rho_fk: 0.25, rho_logprob: 0.32}\n        USED-FOR: {n: 299, rho_sj: 0.18, rho_fk: 0.20, rho_logprob: 0.24}\n        PART-OF: {n: 44, rho_sj: 0.17, rho_fk: 0.25, rho_logprob: 0.28}\n        EVALUATE-FOR: {n: 62, rho_sj: 0.12, rho_fk: 0.18, rho_logprob: 0.22}\n        COMPARE: {n: 35, rho_sj: 0.11, rho_fk: 0.13, rho_logprob: 0.20}\n        FEATURE-OF: {n: 50, rho_sj: 0.01, rho_fk: 0.04, rho_logprob: 0.12}\n      bootstrap_ci_95:\n        re_sj_full: [0.12, 0.30]\n        re_logprob_full: [0.16, 0.34]\n        re_sj_cond: [0.22, 0.44]\n      threshold_sensitivity:\n        thr_0pct_rho_sj: 0.21\n        thr_10pct_rho_sj: 0.28\n        thr_20pct_rho_sj: 0.33\n        thr_30pct_rho_sj: 0.30\n        thr_40pct_rho_sj: 0.25\n      error_propagation:\n        head_tail_error_pct: 55.5\n        type_error_pct: 8.3\n        head_sj_rho: 0.21\n    result_rationale: >\n      RE 诊断结果在 worst 档下：(1) Per-relation-type 分析显示 logprob 在 6/7 relation types 上\n      优于 SJ，只有 HYPONYM-OF（n=36，太小不可靠）SJ 稍弱但 FK 反而最强；\n      (2) Bootstrap CI 表明 SJ full [0.12, 0.30] 与 logprob full [0.16, 0.34] 大量 overlap——\n      reviewer 会说 \"the difference is not statistically significant\"；\n      (3) Threshold sensitivity 呈 inverted-U 但 reviewer 认为 \"this is just an artifact of\n      removing low-performance instances — the remaining instances are easier by definition\"；\n      (4) FEATURE-OF 关系 SJ ρ≈0 证明某些 relation types 对 consistency 完全免疫。\n    tables:\n      - table_id: T-004-1\n        caption: \"RE diagnostic: per-relation-type ρ (SciERC)\"\n        columns: [Relation, n, SJ ρ, FK ρ, Logprob ρ]\n        rows:\n          - [HYPONYM-OF, 36, 0.38, 0.45, 0.42]\n          - [CONJUNCTION, 86, 0.28, 0.25, 0.32]\n          - [USED-FOR, 299, 0.18, 0.20, 0.24]\n          - [PART-OF, 44, 0.17, 0.25, 0.28]\n          - [EVALUATE-FOR, 62, 0.12, 0.18, 0.22]\n          - [COMPARE, 35, 0.11, 0.13, 0.20]\n          - [FEATURE-OF, 50, 0.01, 0.04, 0.12]\n      - table_id: T-004-2\n        caption: \"Threshold sensitivity (conditional exclusion %)\"\n        columns: [\"Exclusion %\", SJ ρ, Logprob ρ, n]\n        rows:\n          - [0%, 0.21, 0.25, 397]\n          - [10%, 0.28, 0.30, 357]\n          - [20%, 0.33, 0.31, 318]\n          - [30%, 0.30, 0.28, 278]\n          - [40%, 0.25, 0.24, 238]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Fig-004-1: Threshold sensitivity curve — inverted-U 峰值在 ~20%，\n        但 reviewer 注意到 logprob 也有类似 pattern，认为 non-specific to SJ\n      - >\n        Fig-004-2: Per-relation heatmap — FEATURE-OF 行全暗色（near-zero），\n        USED-FOR 行（n=299，最大类）也偏弱（SJ=0.18）\n    analysis: >\n      RE 诊断在 worst 档下提供了 task-complexity boundary 的证据，但 reviewer 的反应是\n      \"the boundary is obvious — RE is harder than NER, this doesn't need 397 instances to show.\"\n      Per-relation 分析被视为 descriptive not prescriptive——没有提出 actionable insight\n      告诉 practitioner 如何改进。Bootstrap CI overlap 成为 \"SJ ≈ logprob on RE\" 的直接证据。\n\n  - name: temperature_sensitivity_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-005\n    description: >\n      T=0.7 vs T=1.0 对比，在所有 confidence signal 上分析温度的 signal-noise tradeoff。\n    expected_results:\n      ner_sj_rho_t07: 0.39\n      ner_sj_rho_t10: 0.36\n      ner_sj_delta_temp: -0.03\n      ner_logprob_rho_t07: 0.34\n      ner_logprob_rho_t10: 0.33\n      ner_logprob_delta_temp: -0.01\n      ner_fk_rho_t07: 0.32\n      ner_fk_rho_t10: 0.27\n      ner_fk_delta_temp: -0.05\n      re_sj_rho_t07: 0.23\n      re_sj_rho_t10: 0.21\n      re_logprob_rho_t07: 0.27\n      re_logprob_rho_t10: 0.25\n      ner_mean_sj_t07: 0.78\n      ner_mean_sj_t10: 0.70\n      ner_oracle_t07: 0.758\n      ner_oracle_t10: 0.776\n      sj_temp_robust: true\n      sj_delta_rho_temp: 0.03\n    result_rationale: >\n      温度对 SJ 的影响（Δρ=−0.03）大于对 logprob（Δρ=−0.01），因为 T=1.0 增加的\n      sample diversity 降低了 pairwise SJ 均值（0.78→0.70）并增加了噪声。\n      在 worst 档下 SJ 在 T=0.7 时的 \"最佳\"性能（ρ=0.39）与 logprob（0.34）差距为 +0.05，\n      仍在 focal_rho_gap [-0.04, 0.05] 的上界。Reviewer 会说 \"SJ requires careful\n      temperature tuning to achieve even marginal gains, while logprob is robust to T.\"\n      FK 的温度敏感性（Δ=−0.05）被视为 surface metrics 的又一缺陷。\n      T=1.0 保留更多 oracle headroom（0.776 vs 0.758），但因为 selection 无法利用 headroom，\n      这个观察在 worst 档下变得 moot。\n    tables:\n      - table_id: T-005-1\n        caption: \"Temperature sensitivity: T=0.7 vs T=1.0 (SciERC)\"\n        columns: [Signal, \"NER ρ(T=0.7)\", \"NER ρ(T=1.0)\", Δ, \"RE ρ(T=0.7)\", \"RE ρ(T=1.0)\", Δ]\n        rows:\n          - [Soft Jaccard, 0.39, 0.36, \"−0.03\", 0.23, 0.21, \"−0.02\"]\n          - [Log-prob, 0.34, 0.33, \"−0.01\", 0.27, 0.25, \"−0.02\"]\n          - [Voting conf, 0.38, 0.37, \"−0.01\", 0.31, 0.30, \"−0.01\"]\n          - [Fleiss' κ, 0.32, 0.27, \"−0.05\", 0.22, 0.25, \"+0.03\"]\n          - [Exact-match, 0.28, 0.26, \"−0.02\", 0.11, 0.10, \"−0.01\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Fig-005-1: Paired scatter — 同一 instance 在 T=0.7 和 T=1.0 下的 SJ 值，\n        高相关 (r>0.85) 但 T=1.0 系统性偏低\n    analysis: >\n      温度分析排除了 \"用错温度\" 的 confound，但在 worst 档下这反而是坏消息：\n      即使在最优温度 T=0.7 下 SJ 与 logprob 差距也仅 +0.05 ρ。\n      Reviewer 评论：\"temperature tuning is another hyperparameter burden on top of\n      N-sampling, while logprob is temperature-invariant and nearly as strong.\"\n\n  - name: adaptive_compute_demo\n    plan_id: exp-006\n    description: >\n      Best-of-N selection：用各 confidence signal 选 N 个 sample 中最好的，\n      报告 F1 vs greedy/random/oracle。覆盖所有数据集和任务。\n    expected_results:\n      scierc_ner:\n        greedy: 0.618\n        random: 0.586\n        sj: 0.604\n        logprob: 0.609\n        fk: 0.608\n        voting: 0.596\n        em: 0.603\n        ensemble: 0.604\n        oracle: 0.769\n      scierc_re:\n        greedy: 0.374\n        random: 0.338\n        sj: 0.368\n        logprob: 0.397\n        fk: 0.370\n        voting: 0.338\n        oracle: 0.561\n      conll_ner:\n        greedy: 0.725\n        random: 0.692\n        sj: 0.718\n        logprob: 0.716\n        fk: 0.717\n        voting: 0.714\n        oracle: 0.757\n      ner_all_signals_leq_greedy: true\n      re_only_logprob_beats_greedy: true\n      re_logprob_gain_pp: 2.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      这是 worst 档的核心 negative finding：NER 上 ALL signals ≤ greedy。\n      SJ(0.604) < greedy(0.618) by −1.4pp，logprob(0.609) < greedy(0.618) by −0.9pp。\n      机制：best-of-N selection 需要 PER-SAMPLE ranking ability，而 consistency signals\n      (SJ/voting) 是 INSTANCE-LEVEL aggregates——它们告诉你\"这个 input 容易还是难\"，\n      但不能告诉你\"哪个 sample 更好\"。即使是 logprob（唯一的 per-sample signal）\n      在 NER 上也因为 greedy decode 已经 near-optimal 而无法提供增益。\n      Oracle headroom 巨大（NER +15.1pp，RE +18.7pp）但没有任何 signal 能 exploit 它。\n      RE 上 logprob 是唯一击败 greedy 的 signal（+2.3pp），验证了 per-sample vs instance-level\n      的区分，但 reviewer 的评价是：\"this distinction is well-known in the calibration literature;\n      the authors are re-discovering that aggregate confidence ≠ per-item ranking.\"\n      CoNLL 上所有 signal 都低于 greedy（headroom 仅 3.2pp），进一步确认 ceiling effect。\n    tables:\n      - table_id: T-006-1\n        caption: \"Best-of-N selection F1 (N=8/16, all datasets)\"\n        columns: [Dataset, Task, Greedy, Random, SJ, Logprob, Voting, Oracle]\n        rows:\n          - [SciERC, NER, 0.618, 0.586, 0.604, 0.609, 0.596, 0.769]\n          - [SciERC, RE, 0.374, 0.338, 0.368, 0.397, 0.338, 0.561]\n          - [CoNLL, NER, 0.725, 0.692, 0.718, 0.716, 0.714, 0.757]\n      - table_id: T-006-2\n        caption: \"F1 gain over greedy (pp)\"\n        columns: [Signal, SciERC-NER, SciERC-RE, CoNLL-NER, \"Cost (vs greedy)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Log-prob, \"−0.9\", \"+2.3\", \"−0.9\", \"0× extra\"]\n          - [Soft Jaccard, \"−1.4\", \"−0.6\", \"−0.7\", \"8× inference\"]\n          - [Voting conf, \"−2.2\", \"−3.6\", \"−1.1\", \"8× inference\"]\n          - [Ensemble, \"−1.4\", \"−0.7\", \"—\", \"8× + logprob\"]\n          - [Oracle, \"+15.1\", \"+18.7\", \"+3.2\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Fig-006-1: Selection curves — N vs F1 on SciERC NER，\n        greedy 虚线在所有 signal 之上，oracle 远上方，\n        所有 selection curves 在 greedy 下方是最有视觉冲击力的结果\n      - >\n        Fig-006-2: Cost-effectiveness scatter — x=inference cost, y=ΔF1 vs greedy，\n        所有 consistency signals 在第四象限（高 cost，负 gain），\n        logprob 在 (1×, −0.9) 位置——even logprob doesn't help for NER\n    analysis: >\n      Best-of-N 结果是 worst 档的 headline finding，也是 reviewer 最关注的：\n      \"NER best-of-N 全部 ≤ greedy\" 被解读为 \"the method fundamentally doesn't work\"。\n      即使 reframe 为 correlation-selection gap analysis，reviewer 仍会说\n      \"the paper identifies a gap but offers no solution — purely diagnostic with no\n      positive outcome.\" Oracle gap 的巨大（+15pp NER, +19pp RE）同时是好消息（headroom exists）\n      和坏消息（current signals waste 100% of it on NER）。RE 上 logprob 的成功（+2.3pp）\n      反而削弱了 consistency signals——\"if you want selection, just use logprob.\"\n\n  - name: ner_multi_model\n    plan_id: exp-007\n    description: >\n      LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct 在 SciERC NER/RE 上 fine-tune + inference。\n      Model-agnostic 验证。\n    expected_results:\n      llama_ner_greedy_f1: 0.660\n      llama_ner_oracle_f1: 0.781\n      llama_ner_headroom: 0.121\n      llama_ner_sj_rho: 0.36\n      llama_ner_fk_rho: 0.33\n      llama_ner_logprob_rho: 0.30\n      llama_ner_sj_auroc: 0.68\n      llama_ner_logprob_auroc: 0.62\n      llama_ner_sj_minus_logprob_rho: 0.06\n      llama_re_greedy_f1: 0.434\n      llama_re_sj_rho: 0.30\n      llama_re_fk_rho: 0.31\n      llama_re_logprob_rho: 0.29\n      llama_re_sj_cond_rho: 0.41\n      llama_re_logprob_cond_rho: 0.09\n      llama_ner_sample_f1_pct_zero: 11.6\n      llama_re_sample_f1_pct_zero: 41.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      LLaMA 上 SJ ρ=0.36 与 Qwen3 的 0.36 持平——表面看 model-agnostic，\n      但 worst 档的问题在于 logprob 在 LLaMA 上更弱（ρ=0.30 vs Qwen3 0.33），\n      使得 SJ-logprob gap 在 LLaMA 上稍大（+0.06）但在 Qwen3 上仅 +0.03。\n      Reviewer 会指出：\"the SJ advantage depends on which model you test —\n      on Qwen3 it's +0.03 (not significant), on LLaMA it's +0.06 (marginal).\n      This is not a robust model-agnostic finding.\"\n      RE 上 LLaMA 的 41.2% F1=0 进一步证实了 RE 的 difficulty boundary。\n      LLaMA RE cond SJ ρ=0.41 是一个亮点，但需要 conditional filtering 来展示，\n      而且只在 LLaMA×SciERC 这一个配置上出现。\n    tables:\n      - table_id: T-007-1\n        caption: \"Cross-model comparison: Qwen3-8B vs LLaMA-3.1-8B (SciERC)\"\n        columns: [Signal, Qwen3 NER ρ, LLaMA NER ρ, Δ, Qwen3 RE ρ, LLaMA RE ρ, Δ]\n        rows:\n          - [Soft Jaccard, 0.36, 0.36, 0.00, 0.21, 0.30, \"+0.09\"]\n          - [Log-prob, 0.33, 0.30, \"−0.03\", 0.25, 0.29, \"+0.04\"]\n          - [Voting conf, 0.37, 0.35, \"−0.02\", 0.30, 0.28, \"−0.02\"]\n          - [Fleiss' κ, 0.27, 0.33, \"+0.06\", 0.25, 0.31, \"+0.06\"]\n          - [Exact-match, 0.26, 0.24, \"−0.02\", 0.10, 0.08, \"−0.02\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Fig-007-1: 双模型 bar chart — SJ vs logprob gap 在 Qwen3 和 LLaMA 上方向一致\n        但幅度不稳定（+0.03 vs +0.06），reviewer 关注 instability\n    analysis: >\n      LLaMA 实验的 worst 档解读：model-agnostic 声称依赖于 2 个 8B 模型，\n      reviewer 认为 \"2 models from the same parameter scale is not sufficient for\n      model-agnostic claims — need at least one 70B+ model.\"\n      SJ-logprob gap 的跨模型 variance（+0.03 到 +0.06）被视为 instability。\n      RE 上 SJ 在 LLaMA 上反而比 Qwen3 好（0.30 vs 0.21），但这只是因为 LLaMA 的\n      RE greedy F1 更高（0.434 vs 0.374），更多 instance 进入 \"capability range\"。\n\n  - name: re_n16_confirmation\n    plan_id: exp-008\n    description: >\n      RE N=16 on SciERC，确认 RE negative finding 在更高 N 下仍成立。\n    expected_results:\n      re_sj_rho_n16_full: 0.28\n      re_sj_rho_n16_cond: 0.35\n      re_fk_rho_n16: 0.24\n      re_logprob_rho_n16: 0.30\n      re_voting_rho_n16: 0.32\n      re_n16_vs_n8_sj_delta: 0.07\n      re_oracle_f1_n16: 0.67\n      re_greedy_f1: 0.434\n      re_headroom_n16: 0.236\n      re_sample_f1_pct_zero: 44.3\n      ner_sj_rho_n16: 0.38\n      ner_logprob_rho_n16: 0.33\n    result_rationale: >\n      RE N=16 SJ ρ 从 N=8 的 0.21 升到 0.28（Δ=+0.07），但仍远低于 NER 的 0.38。\n      Worst 档的解读：RE 的改善来自更多 sample 平均了 compound error noise，\n      但 reviewer 会说 \"even at N=16 (doubling compute), RE SJ ρ=0.28 is still\n      well below the NER level — the task-complexity boundary is real and not fixable\n      by more sampling.\" Logprob N=16 ρ=0.30 再次与 SJ 持平或微超。\n      44.3% F1=0 sample 说明 RE 的知识缺口不是 sampling 能解决的。\n      Oracle headroom 从 0.17 升到 0.24 但 selection 仍无法利用。\n    tables:\n      - table_id: T-008-1\n        caption: \"RE N-scaling: N=8 vs N=16 (SciERC)\"\n        columns: [Signal, \"Full ρ@N=8\", \"Full ρ@N=16\", Δ, \"Cond ρ@N=16\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Soft Jaccard, 0.21, 0.28, \"+0.07\", 0.35]\n          - [Voting conf, 0.30, 0.32, \"+0.02\", 0.38]\n          - [Log-prob, 0.25, 0.30, \"+0.05\", 0.27]\n          - [Fleiss' κ, 0.25, 0.24, \"−0.01\", 0.30]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      N=16 RE 的微弱改善在 worst 档下不足以改变结论。Reviewer 说：\n      \"Increasing N from 8 to 16 yields +0.07 ρ for SJ but SJ still underperforms\n      logprob at N=16 (0.28 vs 0.30). The computational cost doubles for negligible gain.\"\n      这个实验是 confirmatory negative——排除了 \"N=8 不够\" 的 excuse。\n\n  - name: capability_stratification\n    plan_id: exp-009\n    description: >\n      按 difficulty strata (greedy F1 buckets + 独立 proxy: sentence length, entity count)\n      分析各 signal 的 ρ 变化。\n    expected_results:\n      scierc_ner:\n        by_greedy_f1:\n          hard_0_25_sj_rho: 0.16\n          med_low_sj_rho: 0.14\n          med_high_sj_rho: 0.09\n          easy_sj_rho: 0.23\n        by_sent_len:\n          Q1_sj_rho: 0.35\n          Q2_sj_rho: 0.32\n          Q3_sj_rho: 0.25\n          Q4_sj_rho: 0.30\n        by_ent_count:\n          zero_sj_rho: 0.52\n          one_two_sj_rho: 0.33\n          three_five_sj_rho: 0.28\n          six_plus_sj_rho: 0.40\n        overall_sj_rho: 0.36\n      scierc_re:\n        by_greedy_f1:\n          hard_sj_rho: -0.04\n          easy_sj_rho: 0.18\n      conll_ner:\n        by_sent_len:\n          Q1_sj_rho: 0.28\n          Q3_sj_rho: 0.38\n      proxy_independence:\n        f1_vs_slen: -0.02\n        f1_vs_ecnt: 0.01\n      inverted_u_confirmed: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档下 inverted-U 假说未被确认：按 greedy F1 bucket 分层后 ρ 没有清晰的\n      中间峰值（med_low=0.14, med_high=0.09 都低于 easy=0.23）。\n      Reviewer 评论：\"the authors claim a task-complexity boundary but the stratification\n      data doesn't show a clean inverted-U — the pattern is noisy and inconsistent.\"\n      用独立 proxy（sentence length）分层后 pattern 更模糊。\n      RE 上 hard bucket SJ ρ=−0.04 是直接 negative——SJ 在困难 RE 实例上是 anti-correlated。\n      Entity count=0 的高 ρ（0.52）是因为 trivially correct（无 entity 要提取），\n      reviewer 会说这 inflates the overall ρ。\n    tables:\n      - table_id: T-009-1\n        caption: \"Stratified ρ by difficulty (SciERC NER)\"\n        columns: [Stratum, n, SJ ρ, Logprob ρ, FK ρ]\n        rows:\n          - [\"F1 0-25%\", 105, 0.16, 0.20, 0.10]\n          - [\"F1 25-50%\", 63, 0.14, 0.18, 0.12]\n          - [\"F1 50-75%\", 142, 0.09, 0.15, 0.08]\n          - [\"F1 75-100%\", 130, 0.23, 0.28, 0.18]\n          - [\"Sent len Q1\", 140, 0.35, 0.30, 0.26]\n          - [\"Sent len Q4\", 132, 0.30, 0.28, 0.22]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Fig-009-1: Scatter — F1 bucket vs ρ，无清晰 inverted-U，\n        散点 noisy 且 logprob 在每个 bucket 都接近或超过 SJ\n    analysis: >\n      Stratification 分析在 worst 档下失败——没有产出 clean diagnostic insight。\n      Reviewer 的 major weakness：\"The diagnostic framework claims to identify\n      capability boundaries but the stratification evidence is weak and inconsistent.\n      This is descriptive, not prescriptive — the paper doesn't tell practitioners\n      anything actionable.\" 这直接对应 R17 (\"diagnostic framework overclaimed\")。\n\n  - name: selection_curves\n    plan_id: exp-010\n    description: >\n      Best-of-N selection curves (N=1,2,4,8,16) 可视化为 line plots。\n    expected_results:\n      scierc_ner:\n        N4: {oracle: 0.714, sj: 0.607, logprob: 0.616, voting: 0.594}\n        N8: {oracle: 0.752, sj: 0.604, logprob: 0.609, voting: 0.591}\n        N16: {oracle: 0.787, sj: 0.606, logprob: 0.612, voting: 0.585}\n        greedy: 0.618\n      scierc_re:\n        N8: {oracle: 0.583, sj: 0.368, logprob: 0.397, voting: 0.338}\n        N16: {oracle: 0.631, sj: 0.372, logprob: 0.405, voting: 0.340}\n        greedy: 0.374\n      conll_ner:\n        N4: {oracle: 0.746, sj: 0.714, logprob: 0.715}\n        N8: {oracle: 0.757, sj: 0.718, logprob: 0.716}\n        greedy: 0.725\n    result_rationale: >\n      Selection curves 在 worst 档下产出了最具视觉冲击力的 negative result：\n      SciERC NER 上所有 signal curves 在 greedy 虚线 BELOW——oracle curve 持续上升到 0.787\n      但所有实际 selection 停留在 0.60-0.61。N 从 4→16 增加时 oracle 持续改善但 selection 不动。\n      Greedy 虚线高高在上（0.618）说明不采样反而更好。\n      CoNLL 上 greedy=0.725 同样高于所有 selection（0.714-0.718），headroom 仅 3.2pp\n      且无法被利用。RE 上 logprob curve 是唯一在 greedy 之上的线（+2.3pp at N=16），\n      其余 signal 全部在 greedy 以下。这幅图本身就是 \"self-consistency doesn't work for IE\"\n      的最直接可视化证据。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Fig-010-1: 3-panel line plot (SciERC NER / SciERC RE / CoNLL NER)，\n        每 panel: x=N, y=F1，lines=Oracle/Greedy/各signal/Random。\n        NER panels 中 greedy 水平虚线在所有 signal 之上。\n        RE panel 中仅 logprob 穿过 greedy。\n        Oracle 和 selection 间的 fan-out 是 correlation-selection gap 的直接可视化。\n    analysis: >\n      Selection curves 是 paper 的 Figure 1 候选——最直观地展示了\n      correlation-selection gap：oracle 证明 headroom 存在，\n      但所有 signal 在 greedy 下方说明 current signals 无法 exploit 它。\n      在 worst 档下 reviewer 的评价是：\"Fig 1 is interesting but the paper\n      doesn't offer any solution — it identifies a problem and stops.\"\n\n  - name: ner_ood_robustness\n    plan_id: exp-011\n    description: >\n      NER consistency signal 在 OOD 实例上的表现（SciERC fine-tuned 模型 on WNUT data）。\n    expected_results:\n      ood_sj_rho: 0.05\n      ood_logprob_rho: 0.15\n      ood_fk_rho: 0.03\n      ood_voting_rho: 0.06\n      ood_greedy_f1: 0.28\n      ood_sample_f1_pct_zero: 62.4\n      ood_mean_sj: 0.38\n      ood_sj_auroc: 0.52\n      ood_logprob_auroc: 0.58\n      ood_degradation_sj: -0.31\n      ood_degradation_logprob: -0.18\n    result_rationale: >\n      OOD 场景下所有 signal 几乎崩溃：SJ ρ=0.05（与 0 无显著差异），\n      logprob ρ=0.15（微弱但存在）。62.4% sample F1=0 说明模型在 OOD 域上\n      大量 hallucinate。SJ 退化幅度（−0.31）远大于 logprob（−0.18），\n      原因：OOD hallucination 可以是 consistent（模型反复产出同一错误 entity set），\n      导致高 SJ 但低 F1（hallucination consistency）。Logprob 在 OOD 时天然偏低，\n      保持了弱单调关系。这在 worst 档下是 \"SJ 在 OOD 上完全失效\" 的证据，\n      但 paper 可能不会报告这个实验（P2 priority）。如果 reviewer 推断其存在\n      会进一步削弱 generalization 主张。\n    tables:\n      - table_id: T-011-1\n        caption: \"In-domain vs OOD signal quality (SciERC model → WNUT data)\"\n        columns: [Signal, \"In-domain ρ\", \"OOD ρ\", Degradation]\n        rows:\n          - [Log-prob, 0.33, 0.15, \"−0.18\"]\n          - [Soft Jaccard, 0.36, 0.05, \"−0.31\"]\n          - [Voting conf, 0.37, 0.06, \"−0.31\"]\n          - [Fleiss' κ, 0.27, 0.03, \"−0.24\"]\n          - [Exact-match, 0.26, 0.04, \"−0.22\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      P2 实验。OOD 退化符合预期但在 worst 档下如果被 reviewer 追问\n      会成为致命弱点。SJ 的 hallucination consistency failure mode\n      是 consistency-based methods 的根本局限性，但 paper 若不主动报告\n      反而显得在回避。\n\n  - name: signal_ensemble_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-016\n    description: >\n      SJ+logprob 相关性分析、线性组合搜索、logistic regression 集成、\n      Best-of-N ensemble selection。\n    expected_results:\n      sj_logprob_pearson_ner: 0.55\n      sj_logprob_pearson_re: 0.40\n      best_linear_ner:\n        combo: SJ+voting_conf\n        alpha: 0.35\n        rho: 0.39\n      best_linear_re:\n        combo: voting_conf+logprob\n        alpha: 0.55\n        rho: 0.33\n      ensemble_ner_auroc: 0.70\n      ensemble_re_auroc: 0.66\n      best_single_ner_auroc: 0.68\n      best_single_re_auroc: 0.64\n      ensemble_ner_delta_auroc: 0.02\n      ensemble_re_delta_auroc: 0.02\n      selection_f1_ner:\n        greedy: 0.618\n        logprob: 0.609\n        sj: 0.604\n        ensemble: 0.606\n        voting: 0.596\n        random: 0.580\n        oracle: 0.769\n      selection_f1_re:\n        logprob: 0.397\n        greedy: 0.374\n        sj: 0.368\n        ensemble: 0.375\n        voting: 0.338\n        random: 0.338\n        oracle: 0.561\n      fk_negative_weight: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Ensemble 的 AUROC 提升仅 +0.02 on NER（0.70 vs best single 0.68），\n      RE 上同样 +0.02。线性组合 best ρ=0.39 仅比 best single(voting 0.37) 高 +0.02。\n      Worst 档的关键：ensemble 没有 meaningful 提升，说明各 signal 高度冗余——\n      它们编码了相似的信息（SJ-logprob Pearson=0.55 证实了这一点）。\n      FK 在 logistic regression 中权重为负——surface agreement 在 structural signals\n      存在时是 net-negative（noisy proxy 被 structural signal dominated）。\n      Best-of-N ensemble selection 同样 ≤ greedy on NER（0.606 < 0.618），\n      RE 上 ensemble(0.375) ≈ greedy(0.374) but < logprob alone(0.397)。\n      Reviewer 评论：\"even combining all signals doesn't help —\n      the correlation-selection gap is fundamental, not fixable by ensembling.\"\n    tables:\n      - table_id: T-016-1\n        caption: \"Signal ensemble analysis (SciERC)\"\n        columns: [Metric, Best Single, Ensemble, Δ]\n        rows:\n          - [NER AUROC, \"0.68 (voting)\", 0.70, \"+0.02\"]\n          - [NER ρ, \"0.37 (voting)\", \"0.39 (SJ+voting α=0.35)\", \"+0.02\"]\n          - [RE AUROC, \"0.64 (voting)\", 0.66, \"+0.02\"]\n          - [RE ρ, \"0.30 (voting)\", \"0.33 (voting+logprob α=0.55)\", \"+0.03\"]\n      - table_id: T-016-2\n        caption: \"Best-of-N selection: ensemble vs individual\"\n        columns: [Signal, NER F1, RE F1]\n        rows:\n          - [Greedy, 0.618, 0.374]\n          - [Logprob, 0.609, 0.397]\n          - [SJ, 0.604, 0.368]\n          - [Ensemble, 0.606, 0.375]\n          - [Voting, 0.596, 0.338]\n          - [Oracle, 0.769, 0.561]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Fig-016-1: Heatmap — logistic regression 系数，FK 为负值（红色），\n        SJ 和 voting 正值接近，logprob 正值中等\n    analysis: >\n      Ensemble 分析回答了 Dream 2 reviewer 的问题但答案是负面的：\n      组合 signal 不产生 meaningful improvement。这支持了 worst 档叙事：\n      \"信号间高度冗余，correlation-selection gap 不是信号不足的问题，\n      而是 instance-level metrics 的结构性局限。\" 但 reviewer 会将此解读为\n      \"insufficient methodological contribution — the paper proposes nothing new.\"\n\n  - name: ner_llama_conll\n    plan_id: exp-017\n    description: >\n      LLaMA-3.1-8B 在 CoNLL-2003 上 fine-tune + inference，\n      扩展 cross-model × cross-dataset validation matrix。\n    expected_results:\n      greedy_f1: 0.924\n      oracle_f1: 0.945\n      oracle_headroom: 0.021\n      n_valid: 2756\n      full:\n        SJ_rho: 0.34\n        FK_rho: 0.33\n        logprob_rho: 0.31\n        EM_rho: 0.34\n        voting_rho: 0.33\n        SJ_AUROC: 0.68\n        logprob_AUROC: 0.66\n      conditional:\n        SJ_rho: 0.35\n        logprob_rho: 0.33\n      sj_minus_logprob_rho: 0.03\n      sj_minus_logprob_auroc: 0.02\n      best_of_n:\n        greedy: 0.924\n        sj_best: 0.920\n        logprob_best: 0.921\n        voting_best: 0.919\n        oracle: 0.945\n      structural_beats_logprob: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      LLaMA×CoNLL 是 2×2 matrix 的最后一个 cell。SJ ρ=0.34 与 Qwen3×CoNLL(0.34)\n      完全一致——structural signal 在 CoNLL 上 model-agnostic（好消息），\n      但 gap vs logprob 仅 +0.03（坏消息）。Greedy F1=0.924 极高（CoNLL 对 LLaMA 很容易），\n      headroom 仅 0.021，best-of-N 所有 signal ≤ greedy（SJ 0.920 < 0.924）。\n      AUROC gap +0.02 在 n=2756 下虽然统计显著但 practical significance 微弱。\n      Worst 档下 reviewer 看到这个结果会说：\"the 2×2 matrix is commendable for rigor,\n      but it confirms that on standard NER, the structural advantage is negligible (+0.02-0.03),\n      and selection never works.\" LLaMA×CoNLL 加入后 cross_config_structural_gt_logprob_rate\n      升到 ~0.70（7/10 configs），但 gap median 仅 +0.03。\n    tables:\n      - table_id: T-017-1\n        caption: \"LLaMA × CoNLL-2003 NER (N=8, T=1.0, n=2756)\"\n        columns: [Signal, \"ρ (full)\", AUROC, \"ρ (cond)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Soft Jaccard, 0.34, 0.68, 0.35]\n          - [Exact-match, 0.34, 0.70, 0.36]\n          - [Voting conf, 0.33, 0.67, 0.34]\n          - [Fleiss' κ, 0.33, 0.66, 0.34]\n          - [Log-prob, 0.31, 0.66, 0.33]\n      - table_id: T-017-2\n        caption: \"2×2 cross-validation matrix summary (NER, SJ ρ full)\"\n        columns: [\" \", Qwen3-8B, LLaMA-3.1-8B]\n        rows:\n          - [SciERC, 0.36, 0.36]\n          - [CoNLL, 0.34, 0.34]\n      - table_id: T-017-3\n        caption: \"2×2 matrix: SJ − Logprob Δρ\"\n        columns: [\" \", Qwen3-8B, LLaMA-3.1-8B]\n        rows:\n          - [SciERC, \"+0.03\", \"+0.06\"]\n          - [CoNLL, \"+0.02\", \"+0.03\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Fig-017-1: 2×2 heatmap — SJ ρ 值，所有 cell 在 0.34-0.36 之间，\n        cross-model×dataset consistency 很高但绝对值不突出\n    analysis: >\n      2×2 matrix 在 worst 档下的价值是双面的：它证明了 robustness（SJ ρ 在 0.34-0.36 \n      跨 model/dataset 一致），但也证明了 mediocrity（gap vs logprob 始终仅 +0.02-0.06，\n      从未达到让 reviewer 说 \"this is meaningful\" 的水平）。\n      Reviewer 总结：\"the authors show a consistent but tiny advantage of structural signals,\n      which does not justify the 8× inference cost nor constitute a sufficient contribution\n      for a main conference paper.\" 这直接导致 R4+R19 的 rejection rationale。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"be60cc2d-21a9-4d86-8473-16b9efb6edfb","total_cost_usd":1.45744115,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":75891,"cache_read_input_tokens":338641,"output_tokens":25771,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":75891,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":24564,"cache_read_input_tokens":56191,"cache_creation_input_tokens":31541,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":31541},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":35641,"outputTokens":1925,"cacheReadInputTokens":33409,"cacheCreationInputTokens":96704,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.1694869,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":8,"outputTokens":25771,"cacheReadInputTokens":338641,"cacheCreationInputTokens":75891,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.28795425,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"38ccdef3-87c5-4d13-a9c6-4df6d99a8b3d"}
